	('0a3e57f7-97e2-4079-b8ad-90cf42fd23a6', '50528bde-c1ca-4b6b-b2d3-800259218fc7', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'You two should chat! You’re both amazing leaders in education with rich backgrounds as coordinators with a passion for vulnerable leadership.', '2025-03-28 21:10:42.281625+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-03-28 21:10:44.117+00', 'completed', 'let''s reconnect you two later!', '2025-04-17 15:31:24.432+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('663dd69b-d634-4f0d-b28f-abf688fd8bd5', 'd8e9db8f-f716-4f11-9fb9-c204d951fd7d', '1da551dd-7a97-4556-a99d-5c3536a61caf', 'Hi Katie and Mike! You’re both incredible high school teachers with rich insights into learning. Use Upduo (in your toolbox) to connect at a time that works for you.', '2025-03-19 15:55:39.412586+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-03-19 15:55:41.245+00', 'completed', 'In a rich and energizing conversation, educators Katie Stahl and Mike Mendelson connected over their shared passion for leveraging AI to deepen learning and increase equity in their classrooms. They exchanged concrete strategies—ranging from live translation in PowerPoint to adaptive text-leveling and AI-generated escape rooms—that are transforming how they reach multilingual learners and differentiate instruction. Both described how AI tools have helped them bring ambitious ideas to life, scaffold complex content, and maintain academic rigor for all students, particularly those navigating language barriers. Their dialogue revealed a deep commitment to learner agency, choice, and engagement, as well as a mutual appreciation for peer collaboration as professional nourishment. Katie, newly appointed to an AI-focused committee, is seeking ways to lead responsible, future-ready AI integration at the district level. Meanwhile, Mike is using AI to support peer teaching and interdisciplinary innovation. Their conversation reflected curiosity, joy, and a strong sense of purpose—as they explore how AI might not replace teachers, but empower them to reimagine what''s possible.', '2025-03-26 22:52:03.691+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('7b23a8b7-d159-4934-ae18-5f3a136ac36f', '44d8b840-888f-4849-9111-b52ada8f4599', '86f608d8-be4a-47b2-9c8a-b0b3fb52dabb', 'Hi Brittany and Michael! You two should chat. 
