[Jeff C.]: Thank you. Have a great day, Lori. [Lorri E.]: OK.', 'vtt_transcript', 0.8, false, 'guts_vs_fear', 'deleted', '{"Lorri E. - Using AI to enhance thinking and learning","Jeff C. - Creating inclusive learning environments"}', '{"Lorri E. - Concerns about AI replacing human thinking and learning","Jeff C. - Challenges of segregating students based on ability"}', 'Lorri E.: I think that if learners do not understand the benefit of actually doing the thinking themselves, that it could be detrimental to learners if they use it as a tool to enhance their real learning.', true, '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4');


