	('9451ae4f-d10b-4866-b15a-f5f58181e406', '1304930c-0a71-4620-a1fe-a12406eca460', 'Given the absence of a specific conversation transcript, I will analyze the provided sources to identify relevant quotes that reveal participants'' teaching stances or educational philosophies.

