	('3cd89090-9efb-4b62-8a02-57463293abda', '765b8cf9-3d59-4387-b038-5c44d750a488', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'That''s a great question. I''m leaning on the notifications now (you can do text/sms too)', '2025-04-21 21:24:45.724633+00', '2025-04-21 21:24:45.724633+00', 'user', NULL),
	('368633a5-2081-40cb-b369-d993c602671f', 'e16823ac-2fd9-4892-baeb-da75481f9692', '59e9f386-0ecc-4201-99dd-802f7f8e7b33', 'Would Thurs work for you?', '2025-04-22 05:40:01.327029+00', '2025-04-22 05:40:01.327029+00', 'user', NULL),
	('4e56738a-745e-4bb9-9a59-5b73f9013ca3', '3d0c979f-f010-4ea0-b6c4-90f46901b055', '4bb175fe-ebd9-4641-9edc-593037b6152d', 'Hi Tiana! I''m happy to see we''ve been matched. Would you like to find a time to connect?', '2025-04-22 07:23:40.841714+00', '2025-04-22 07:23:40.841714+00', 'user', NULL),
	('b5eafd91-47e2-4c2a-9a7a-a0685bb59f2e', '623cfb70-c697-406a-a58e-2cdbb9945f08', '11e8adeb-72d2-4cb4-ae26-24d4d1e7565a', 'Hi Samuel. I just wanted to reach out to see if you want to collaborate around our work.  No pressure. I am just really trying to see how this system works.', '2025-04-08 21:31:11.908251+00', '2025-04-08 21:31:11.908251+00', 'user', NULL),
	('b82ba36e-89bd-444d-9b3a-a3015fa184fc', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '0da1de28-4910-465c-a5f3-0e6d3f975b5e', 'Haha, okay - I can totally see how this is tough for people. Without notifications for when you''ve responded, I totally forget to check in. So sorry. Obviously I missed this window!', '2025-04-09 00:04:40.153426+00', '2025-04-09 00:04:40.153426+00', 'user', NULL),
	('5d727120-54f2-4666-921f-170d070947ab', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '0da1de28-4910-465c-a5f3-0e6d3f975b5e', 'Can we try something for Thursday?', '2025-04-09 00:04:51.312278+00', '2025-04-09 00:04:51.312278+00', 'user', NULL),
	('d028eed3-9004-4c61-9de7-8477246637a4', '6eb86849-eab9-4801-a435-9059c41a6106', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Hi Maria, I''m pretty flexible weekdays 7-5 pacific. When''s good for you?', '2025-04-09 17:21:25.712405+00', '2025-04-09 17:21:25.712405+00', 'user', NULL),
	('bc980ede-f078-4493-a1fb-e17f5923a5b5', '6eb86849-eab9-4801-a435-9059c41a6106', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'I''d love to catch up and hear more about what you''ve been doing!', '2025-04-09 17:21:45.58623+00', '2025-04-09 17:21:45.58623+00', 'user', NULL),
	('294a6e50-5d23-4eee-8c48-78e20b32e284', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Yes! That''s been the rub for sure. Supposedly the notifications are working (or will be soon) haha.', '2025-04-09 17:23:01.172649+00', '2025-04-09 17:23:01.172649+00', 'user', NULL),
	('a4f742c9-d5a1-4bdd-8579-5ef22782a798', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Invite sent for Thursday! (Still says Robot even though "Sideby Robot" is the google account first name...weird)', '2025-04-09 17:26:44.356923+00', '2025-04-09 17:26:44.356923+00', 'user', NULL),
	('2913d1ca-a4de-4deb-ae5b-cf41e3ab549d', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '0da1de28-4910-465c-a5f3-0e6d3f975b5e', 'Can we do Thurs afternoon versus morning? The early times kill me a bit haha', '2025-04-09 17:35:40.707493+00', '2025-04-09 17:35:40.707493+00', 'user', NULL),
	('a9ae94de-b6c8-4e5a-b6bf-e007862dbd22', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'For sure!', '2025-04-09 18:00:03.79507+00', '2025-04-09 18:00:03.79507+00', 'user', NULL),
	('dd92e0c1-5ad4-4f9c-90f5-d740d06a219a', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '0da1de28-4910-465c-a5f3-0e6d3f975b5e', 'Excellent! Thank you! Talk tmrw :)', '2025-04-09 18:01:49.073695+00', '2025-04-09 18:01:49.073695+00', 'user', NULL),
	('26d8e4ac-0d3e-4722-9cc5-52480dad4965', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Looking forward to it. Remember we''ll meet in the upduo tool. It looks like you still have your initial reflection to do first before we''ll be matched', '2025-04-09 18:03:37.05538+00', '2025-04-09 18:03:37.05538+00', 'user', NULL),
	('86ef8b3b-bd58-4af4-8531-16f767496acf', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '0da1de28-4910-465c-a5f3-0e6d3f975b5e', 'How and where do I do that?', '2025-04-09 19:42:56.514445+00', '2025-04-09 19:42:56.514445+00', 'user', NULL),
	('2c7d48fb-4648-474f-87a0-8c6f44f3bf0f', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Toolbox, download the app "Upduo" (soon to be Sideby)', '2025-04-09 22:00:31.238974+00', '2025-04-09 22:00:31.238974+00', 'user', NULL),
	('d301f2c2-4db2-461d-a727-d9f8527cb2cd', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Community = washington', '2025-04-09 22:01:27.476101+00', '2025-04-09 22:01:27.476101+00', 'user', NULL),
	('19298df1-fd49-4066-b1e0-53d37d3af28f', 'e8f99693-7f2a-4f86-852d-170b0ecdb04f', '4bb175fe-ebd9-4641-9edc-593037b6152d', 'Is there another time in the near future that can work for you since we missed connecting today? I have availability (UKT) on Monday between 8:30 and 11:30 or later in the day, pretty much any time after 15:15. Tuesday is also good with space from your 8:30 to 12:30. Let me know if you have space in there and want to try again! I hope you have a great weekend.', '2025-04-25 16:46:12.969993+00', '2025-04-25 16:46:12.969993+00', 'user', NULL),
	('774a4108-600c-4362-ba28-d4f1fcfef505', 'af08693a-693c-4c20-936f-5d4220330d4d', 'cd985910-e971-4907-988f-d311b2adb4d1', 'Tiana, Wednesday would probably work best for me.', '2025-04-25 17:02:27.914296+00', '2025-04-25 17:02:27.914296+00', 'user', NULL),
	('bb8dcf69-d9fc-4848-aae9-3213f61f5e5f', '2aa88f3f-0f07-4f9e-aea6-2df53b2f8928', 'd3be9b68-297b-416b-828a-eabddea74cb7', 'hello', '2025-04-25 17:45:27.620266+00', '2025-04-25 17:45:27.620266+00', 'user', NULL),
	('6c30d39e-3513-4520-b69c-e2c6c139c06d', 'af08693a-693c-4c20-936f-5d4220330d4d', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'I''ll send an invite for next Wednesday. Hoping this is helpful. - Jeff', '2025-04-25 17:47:03.584248+00', '2025-04-25 17:47:03.584248+00', 'admin', NULL),
	('44b5c830-6a92-496e-9150-2293cd433c13', '3d0c979f-f010-4ea0-b6c4-90f46901b055', '4bb175fe-ebd9-4641-9edc-593037b6152d', 'Hi Tiana. Just following up to see if it might work for you to connect tomorrow morning. If not, no biggie. We can try another time. I hope you have a great weekend!', '2025-04-25 19:23:53.590808+00', '2025-04-25 19:23:53.590808+00', 'user', NULL),
	('6e1724f4-689c-4120-bd0f-8c8dfabd450f', 'f326825a-b9fb-4258-ad78-1bfe0e90e46f', 'ea155ac4-eb3a-4e24-a4be-84f0143f4348', 'can you meet on saturday', '2025-04-25 19:48:22.445268+00', '2025-04-25 19:48:22.445268+00', 'user', NULL),
	('bc49ed76-0bf8-4ea0-a20f-01f1d7798ee1', 'af08693a-693c-4c20-936f-5d4220330d4d', 'cd985910-e971-4907-988f-d311b2adb4d1', 'Thanks Jeff and looking forward to talking with you next week Tiana. Have a nice weekend!', '2025-04-25 20:08:19.697902+00', '2025-04-25 20:08:19.697902+00', 'user', NULL),
	('5464580f-5266-40c0-8b63-9ede8fcaa22e', 'af08693a-693c-4c20-936f-5d4220330d4d', '45a4fa1a-ba74-4b76-b607-072b45ea750b', 'Thanks Jeff, Also looking forward to talk to you Robert!!', '2025-04-25 20:31:35.785985+00', '2025-04-25 20:31:35.785985+00', 'user', NULL),
	('89a08d79-cd54-4ecc-9933-ca878431e4eb', '82cd4c7c-474f-4897-8346-53641752de69', '4734e9cf-74b7-4e89-b92c-8dc6f49c5b2a', 'What does Monday or Thursday look like for you this week?', '2025-04-26 17:29:42.42841+00', '2025-04-26 17:29:42.42841+00', 'user', NULL),
	('19139ce3-9701-4a89-9124-2c8f83f93ee6', 'c9e20b81-43bb-4533-abe4-09e7b0a18a0d', '539532da-e238-4c53-8533-94fe266e7d01', 'Sure. That works. Do you want to zoom? I can send you a link if you send me your email address.', '2025-04-26 17:31:55.406528+00', '2025-04-26 17:31:55.406528+00', 'user', NULL),
	('bb770810-0aa5-4d42-882e-768b1c23156b', 'c9e20b81-43bb-4533-abe4-09e7b0a18a0d', '369c68b2-4de2-4ba9-884c-a26d3e5a426d', 'Ok great, lets meet Thursday at 1pm PT. I think if we schedule that time and day, Sideby.ai will schedule us. We can then go the app and connect automatically.', '2025-04-28 15:19:20.112101+00', '2025-04-28 15:19:20.112101+00', 'user', NULL),
	('601767fe-54f4-463f-baac-af7c2e01add3', 'c9e20b81-43bb-4533-abe4-09e7b0a18a0d', '539532da-e238-4c53-8533-94fe266e7d01', 'Sounds good. I will block off 1:00 pm pacific time on my calendar.', '2025-04-28 15:39:08.543815+00', '2025-04-28 15:39:08.543815+00', 'user', NULL),
	('934db52d-48da-430a-992b-0415f37975e2', 'e8f99693-7f2a-4f86-852d-170b0ecdb04f', '59e9f386-0ecc-4201-99dd-802f7f8e7b33', 'Oh no! Sorry! I didn''t get a notification about these messages. *sigh* I think this week might be out for me, can we look at next week? I can''t wait to connect!', '2025-04-29 10:10:27.463931+00', '2025-04-29 10:10:27.463931+00', 'user', NULL),
	('7306cf5a-7047-421f-a369-539dbdc622dc', 'e8f99693-7f2a-4f86-852d-170b0ecdb04f', '4bb175fe-ebd9-4641-9edc-593037b6152d', 'No problem at all. I have friends visiting next week so my calendar is a little fuller than usual. Things open up again after the 11th. Let''s find a time in there!', '2025-04-29 13:18:05.535252+00', '2025-04-29 13:18:05.535252+00', 'user', NULL),
	('dcbcc356-a395-4b38-acdf-7e2a2ff28a01', '715aa435-6f40-4635-9f04-8881174b0f57', '43812edc-e7fd-4226-bb9c-cd9bd174e0b0', 'Hi Dox!  Sorry for the delay, pleasure to meet you as well.  Sorry this time of year is crazy for me and lost track of this.  I see you''re a micro school founder, I would love to learn more!', '2025-04-29 17:03:46.601169+00', '2025-04-29 17:03:46.601169+00', 'user', NULL),
	('4c909ce5-b00f-432f-982c-17d60cd8fedf', 'abb94bfc-94b4-43de-a50e-e78e7c88404c', '1e39285c-a332-4528-9b84-5b399b1863a8', 'Hi Jason.', '2025-04-29 22:51:43.250536+00', '2025-04-29 22:51:43.250536+00', 'user', NULL),
	('3edf5147-5889-4f8c-ab93-4d846ee4311b', 'e8f99693-7f2a-4f86-852d-170b0ecdb04f', '59e9f386-0ecc-4201-99dd-802f7f8e7b33', 'Ok! Sounds good!', '2025-04-30 09:25:24.963115+00', '2025-04-30 09:25:24.963115+00', 'user', NULL),
	('0a57c8cc-7bae-48b3-aa99-b51b34645e21', 'f326825a-b9fb-4258-ad78-1bfe0e90e46f', 'ea155ac4-eb3a-4e24-a4be-84f0143f4348', 'How about next Wednesday at 10:00am (for our next learning cycle)?', '2025-04-30 16:14:42.019123+00', '2025-04-30 16:14:42.019123+00', 'user', 'America/Los_Angeles'),
	('5004a280-8650-4f3b-83c0-7dc9e13ee7b9', 'af08693a-693c-4c20-936f-5d4220330d4d', 'cd985910-e971-4907-988f-d311b2adb4d1', 'I am in upduo now and it is not pairing us up (I got on a little early, 12:20ish). I sent an email to Jeff and messaged him in slack.', '2025-04-30 19:30:56.731758+00', '2025-04-30 19:30:56.731758+00', 'user', NULL),
	('8f2d9020-3d78-4ff3-91db-e07a9372fac0', 'af08693a-693c-4c20-936f-5d4220330d4d', '45a4fa1a-ba74-4b76-b607-072b45ea750b', 'Yes I was also in updo at 12:25ish and it lead to wanting me to do a solo session', '2025-04-30 20:02:09.291414+00', '2025-04-30 20:02:09.291414+00', 'user', NULL),
	('d8b7c7c5-aa7e-4366-ae3b-5c8a6682ee11', 'af08693a-693c-4c20-936f-5d4220330d4d', 'cd985910-e971-4907-988f-d311b2adb4d1', 'I got on about 12:20 and it did the same thing to me. I exited out and tried to connect again. I will pass this info onto Jeff and the sideby team. It is a bummer we weren''t able to chat. Maybe next week?', '2025-04-30 20:17:09.151466+00', '2025-04-30 20:17:09.151466+00', 'user', NULL),
	('71c3265a-38b5-47cb-866e-52d7160671f6', 'af08693a-693c-4c20-936f-5d4220330d4d', 'cd985910-e971-4907-988f-d311b2adb4d1', 'I hope you have a great rest of your week and a wonderful weekend!', '2025-04-30 20:17:50.299947+00', '2025-04-30 20:17:50.299947+00', 'user', NULL),
	('191e1471-d7f3-4d98-8a83-8e2e27a764bb', 'af08693a-693c-4c20-936f-5d4220330d4d', '45a4fa1a-ba74-4b76-b607-072b45ea750b', 'Yes next week same time and day works for me, thank you for reaching out to the team, hopefully the bug is fixed soon!', '2025-04-30 20:45:34.587018+00', '2025-04-30 20:45:34.587018+00', 'user', NULL),
	('4a4383ad-4a28-470f-a854-37613ea9404a', 'af08693a-693c-4c20-936f-5d4220330d4d', '45a4fa1a-ba74-4b76-b607-072b45ea750b', 'Hope you have a great rest of your week as well', '2025-04-30 20:46:14.478937+00', '2025-04-30 20:46:14.478937+00', 'user', NULL);


