ople for like if from 10 years old on. \",\"startTime\":1739896802,\"endTime\":1739896805},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s, I think it will.\",\"startTime\":1739896808,\"endTime\":1739896812},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739896808,\"endTime\":1739896808},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"I think one of the biggest changes or things that will.\",\"startTime\":1739896813,\"endTime\":1739896816},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Help, but that will kind of coax everyone to go through is is self reflection sooner than later. \",\"startTime\":1739896817,\"endTime\":1739896825},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Like we like all we have asked for as students.\",\"startTime\":1739896828,\"endTime\":1739896833},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"De facto.\",\"startTime\":1739896833,\"endTime\":1739896834},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"I mean de jure theoretically you know, to learn the osmosis absorbed information, but de facto is to just get the solution, get the grade, you know, get this, get the get the paper and then get the money, right? That''s and the shortest \",\"startTime\":1739896835,\"endTime\":1739896848},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"path possible while doing the least amount of work. \",\"startTime\":1739896848,\"endTime\":1739896852},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"OK, well, what? What''s the solution to that? That we''ve been asking for a machine, \",\"startTime\":1739896854,\"endTime\":1739896858},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"right, that gives us those answers so that if I do no work. \",\"startTime\":1739896858,\"endTime\":1739896863},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"And get all the benefit. Congrats, now we have that.\",\"startTime\":1739896863,\"endTime\":1739896866},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Now what my students, umm, now we actually have to think, OK, well, maybe I should learn something here because that''s what I guess I just paid for, right? \",\"startTime\":1739896869,\"endTime\":1739896877},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Umm, or should I, should I just continue using it? I think that''s what a lot \",\"startTime\":1739896877,\"endTime\":1739896881},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739896879,\"endTime\":1739896881},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"of students, what we''re going, are beginning to think about. And as a result, \",\"startTime\":1739896881,\"endTime\":1739896885},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"like we''ll have to actually reflect on it like that. Like about like they can \",\"startTime\":1739896885,\"endTime\":1739896889},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"get their education now on paper. Will they actually be educated? That''s a question \",\"startTime\":1739896889,\"endTime\":1739896893},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"they have to answer. \",\"startTime\":1739896893,\"endTime\":1739896898},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"That''s the way it''s shaping the way they think about their role, I think.\",\"startTime\":1739896906,\"endTime\":1739896908},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah and yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739896906,\"endTime\":1739896907},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, that''s so interesting. Yep. OK.\",\"startTime\":1739896909,\"endTime\":1739896912},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Next, read the challenges and choose one.\",\"startTime\":1739896916,\"endTime\":1739896919},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Set What''s your story? You''ve heard mine.\",\"startTime\":1739896923,\"endTime\":1739896926},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I started moving into education, so in college I was like, I''m going to be a pediatric oncologist. My mom had cancer. I want to work with kids. I''m going \",\"startTime\":1739896928,\"endTime\":1739896937},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"to solve that problem. \",\"startTime\":1739896937,\"endTime\":1739896937},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"And then I volunteered at Sloan Kettering in New York City and saw how much the kids hated their doctors because they inflicted. So if you''re little, they \",\"startTime\":1739896937,\"endTime\":1739896946},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"inflict a lot of pain. They heal you. But that, like, this stuff hurts. \",\"startTime\":1739896946,\"endTime\":1739896951},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"So after really seeing kids like cower from doctors, I realized that wasn''t going to be where I was going to. I couldn''t, I couldn''t do that. That wasn''t \",\"startTime\":1739896952,\"endTime\":1739896960},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"for me. So I shifted into like, OK, we''ll be counseling with students. What \",\"startTime\":1739896960,\"endTime\":1739896964},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"will it be? And moved into teaching and realized too, I, I was familiar with \",\"startTime\":1739896964,\"endTime\":1739896968},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"schools, familiar with the format, but I didn''t love school. I just like won \",\"startTime\":1739896968,\"endTime\":1739896973},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"at school. I didn''t love learning yet I loved learning certain things in certain \",\"startTime\":1739896973,\"endTime\":1739896977},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"areas with certain teachers. \",\"startTime\":1739896977,\"endTime\":1739896981},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"And so then moved into this program that was in the South Bronx that was innovative, project based, New York City, Outward Bound connected. So we did a big like \",\"startTime\":1739896983,\"endTime\":1739896991},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739896984,\"endTime\":1739897001},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"backpacking to kick off 9th grade year like all, and it just expanded my mind to what was possible in schools. Fell in love with that model and then worked \",\"startTime\":1739896991,\"endTime\":1739896998},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"for that organization, started that school in Northern California with that same approach. Mike was our founding math teacher. \",\"startTime\":1739896998,\"endTime\":1739897006},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"And really just went all in on.\",\"startTime\":1739897008,\"endTime\":1739897011},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"School can be.\",\"startTime\":1739897011,\"endTime\":1739897012},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Oh wow.\",\"startTime\":1739897011,\"endTime\":1739897012},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Like our wildest dreams in public. They were both Republic. My California one \",\"startTime\":1739897013,\"endTime\":1739897016},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"was public charter, but it wasn''t funded different and all kids were open. There \",\"startTime\":1739897016,\"endTime\":1739897020},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"was no like application. You can''t come in. \",\"startTime\":1739897020,\"endTime\":1739897023},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"So seeing how I''m my story really has to do with like what''s possible in education, how can I do good but also. \",\"startTime\":1739897026,\"endTime\":1739897033},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Want to do good in ways that work for me like I, I, I.\",\"startTime\":1739897033,\"endTime\":1739897035},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I know doing good as a pediatric oncologist is important, but that wasn''t going to be for me. And then thinking about now like. \",\"startTime\":1739897036,\"endTime\":1739897044},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"As someone who was in schools for 15 years, I deeply respect that work. But \",\"startTime\":1739897044,\"endTime\":1739897048},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I love being remote. I love doing kind of a variety of things, and I love. \",\"startTime\":1739897048,\"endTime\":1739897053},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I respect the people who are in schools every day, but I don''t want to be in a school every day, not anymore. \",\"startTime\":1739897054,\"endTime\":1739897059},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah, a lot. Yeah. I can kind of relate in that. Like, I don''t know how much \",\"