te increments. So I wanna build \",\"startTime\":1744725546,\"endTime\":1744725550},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"a tool that I can use to like actually focus my work and then manage different projects within using that Pomodoro timer to like check off tasks, like tie them all together is like what I would like, I would love like a life planner. \",\"startTime\":1744725550,\"endTime\":1744725562},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Like none of them are like perfect though, you know? \",\"startTime\":1744725562,\"endTime\":1744725567},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1744725567,\"endTime\":1744725567},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It''s like we''re still in control at the end of the day. And I''m like, I want \",\"startTime\":1744725568,\"endTime\":1744725572},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"you to do it because you can do it. But wait, I haven''t. I haven''t built you \",\"startTime\":1744725572,\"endTime\":1744725575},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, right.\",\"startTime\":1744725574,\"endTime\":1744725575},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"yet. I haven''t invented you yet, and I don''t know how it''s gonna work. \",\"startTime\":1744725575,\"endTime\":1744725579},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725579,\"endTime\":1744725580},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I love it. OK, next one, and then I''m going to add in the word lovable. \",\"startTime\":1744725581,\"endTime\":1744725586},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Have you seen the AI tool called Lovable? It builds apps. It''s like ChatGPT, \",\"startTime\":1744725586,\"endTime\":1744725591},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"but it builds the apps for you. That''s crazy. \",\"startTime\":1744725591,\"endTime\":1744725596},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"So yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725592,\"endTime\":1744725594},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725595,\"endTime\":1744725596},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Y