Time\":1744725857,\"endTime\":1744725861},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Hmm. Oh, wow. What a great story. That''s pretty transformational. And not just \",\"startTime\":1744725864,\"endTime\":1744725868},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"pretty transformable, That''s incredibly transformational that your experience made you go back to the classroom and just like, no flipping it. We got to do \",\"startTime\":1744725868,\"endTime\":1744725876},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1744725869,\"endTime\":1744725870},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, I had a student teacher and then.\",\"startTime\":1744725876,\"endTime\":1744725879},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"something way different. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1744725876,\"endTime\":1744725880},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Which was kind of like, was helpful for me to like sort of see and you know, like they, you, you sort of teach the way you were taught. And we had like, \",\"startTime\":1744725879,\"endTime\":1744725887},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"there was nothing wrong with him. He was a wonderful person. And like, he, he, \",\"startTime\":1744725887,\"endTime\":1744725890},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I''m sure he would turn out to be a great teacher too, in his own right. But \",\"startTime\":1744725890,\"endTime\":1744725894},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"what I saw was like, I was like, yeah, I don''t want to do this anymore in that way. And it''s just not, it''s not enough. And I''ve never been one to sort of \",\"startTime\":1744725894,\"endTime\":1744725902},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"like. \",\"startTime\":1744725902,\"endTime\":1744725906},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Slow down. I always want to go 1000 miles an hour and keep pushing. And you \",\"startTime\":1744725907,\"endTime\":1744725911},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"know, and this has become my outlet, my technology leadership here. I built \",\"startTime\":1744725911,\"endTime\":1744725915},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"a company. \",\"startTime\":1744725915,\"endTime\":1744725919},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Left, left the company and now I''m on the board of it. I''m on the board of another \",\"startTime\":1744725920,\"endTime\":1744725924},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"company. We''re we''re doing a lot of work with lovable there too, as well, building \",\"startTime\":1744725924,\"endTime\":1744725928},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"my own LLC. So it''s like, you know, just it, it totally changed my life for \",\"startTime\":1744725928,\"endTime\":1744725932},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"sure. \",\"startTime\":1744725932,\"endTime\":1744725936},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Wow, wow.\",\"startTime\":1744725936,\"endTime\":1744725937},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What a wonderful example that you gave to your kids and your students. That \",\"startTime\":1744725937,\"endTime\":1744725942},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"There.\",\"startTime\":1744725941,\"endTime\":1744725942},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"is, I''m thinking and the student teacher of being so transparent similarly on my story, diving in and then having those transformative experiences go. \",\"startTime\":1744725942,\"endTime\":1744725952},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725948,\"endTime\":1744725949},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"One thing that I in my story that''s come through and through and I realized that I was a classic high school math teacher. I did that for 17 years at 1 \",\"startTime\":1744725953,\"endTime\":1744725962},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"high school in Spokane and I did the tech stuff and along the way I was doing TI89, how to use the calculators or this or that because I''m like, hey, we got a tool, why don''t we use it? \",\"startTime\":1744725962,\"endTime\":1744725975},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1744725966,\"endTime\":1744725966},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And computers and computer software and technology and putting in projects into my classroom. \",\"startTime\":1744725976,\"endTime\":1744725981},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1744725977,\"endTime\":1744725977},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But it really wasn''t until.\",\"startTime\":1744725981,\"endTime\":1744725982},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Was 2005 we opened up Spokane virtual learning. It was when in Spokane we wanted \",\"startTime\":1744725985,\"endTime\":1744725990},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"to do online learning and. \",\"startTime\":1744725990,\"endTime\":1744725994},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Hilarious. COVID was at the 15 year anniversary. I had left the district by \",\"startTime\":1744725995,\"endTime\":1744725999},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"then, but it challenged me to think about and really I was kind of bored in the classroom. I had done the classic, taught like I was. \",\"startTime\":1744725999,\"endTime\":1744726007},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Used to teaching because that''s what I had experienced from all these things and would like listen to other people and read a lot, but if you haven''t experienced it yourself it''s really hard to teach that way. \",\"startTime\":1744726008,\"endTime\":1744726018},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726015,\"endTime\":1744726016},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And uh, I was walking home with nothing in my hands at the end of the day with my contract said I could and I was kinda like. \",\"startTime\":1744726018,\"endTime\":1744726026},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726019,\"endTime\":1744726020},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And they gave me the chance to write a course for freshman math like Algebra one or integrated 1. \",\"startTime\":1744726027,\"endTime\":1744726034},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I''m sitting there in 2005 going.\",\"startTime\":1744726034,\"endTime\":1744726037},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Wait a second, may have Google at home. I don''t even get to see these kids. \",\"startTime\":1744726039,\"endTime\":1744726042},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"They have all of these software bits. They have Mathematica, they have this, \",\"startTime\":1744726042,\"endTime\":1744726045},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"they have that. \",\"startTime\":1744726045,\"endTime\":1744726048},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726048,\"endTime\":1744726048},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"They have they have calculator emulators and I know it was only 2005 compared to today, but still like how do you write curriculum and how do you ask or the the main question of how do you facilitate learning? That''s what I realized \",\"startTime\":1744726049,\"endTime\":1744726062},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Bien, bien.\",\"startTime\":1744726055,\"endTime\":1744726056},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it was and then when I hopped into that boat. \",\"startTime\":1744726062,\"endTime\":1744726066},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Realizing, holy crap, how do you facilitate learning? And it became for me that \",\"startTime\":1744726067,\"endTime\":1744726071},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"that moment of transparency where I was really authentically growing as a learner and I didn''t know all the answers. That''s when I got the best. That''s when it \",\"startTime\":1744726071,\"endTime\":1744726080},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"changed for me. And it was encouraging to hear you say that for your students \",\"startTime\":1744726080,\"endTime\":1744726084},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"and for your student teacher. They saw you in that wobbly phase. They saw you \",\"startTime\":1744726084,\"endTime\":1744726088},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"figuring it out. They still see you figuring out today. And now I know, ''cause \",\"startTime\":1744726088,\"endTime\":1744726093},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I''m just passionate about how we learn and what works and what doesn''t work. \",\"startTime\":1744726093,\"endTime\":1744726097},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Is that that''s a key component? Is that we see each other as learners?\",\"startTime\":1744726097,\"endTime\":1744726101},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And that, as you said, executive functioning, we get out of the back of our head afraid because, oh wait, Mike''s demonstrating that he''s a learner too. \",\"startTime\":1744726101,\"endTime\":1744726109},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I feel safe and I''m a learner too. I feel like I belong. He''s inviting me \",\"startTime\":1744726109,\"endTime\":1744726112},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"in. And then I can get into my executive functioning and I can really engage \",\"startTime\":1744726112,\"endTime\":1744726116},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"as a problem solver. So it helps us. I''ve learned in my practice and not just \",\"startTime\":1744726116,\"endTime\":1744726119},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"the research I''ve been reading. \",\"startTime\":1744726119,\"endTime\":1744726123},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That when we''re transparent and putting ourselves at that zone of proximal development and learning and being vulnerable about it to our students, our learners, our colleagues. \",\"startTime\":1744726123,\"endTime\":1744726133},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1744726130,\"endTime\":1744726130},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"We''re all better for it, so it''s fun to hear you say that and just embracing it. Oh. \",\"startTime\":1744726134,\"endTime\":1744726138},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726136,\"endTime\":1744726137},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And it''s funny that I mean, I think there''s like definitely the one of the threads that seems very common there is that there''s there was this sort of a moment where your reflection on like your practice revealed sort of like a. \",\"startTime\":1744726140,\"endTime\":1744726153},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Maybe a flaw in the lodge much like mine did. It was like a flaw in the logic \",\"startTime\":1744726154,\"endTime\":1744726157},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"of like, well, if I if I tell you to do, you will, you will do and therefore you will learn. It was like. \",\"startTime\":1744726157,\"endTime\":1744726163},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"The technology has made, has commoditized, has commoditized information 1st through the Internet, you know, which we both experienced in that 2000, early 2000s there and then, you know, software and now AI are commoditizing. \",\"startTime\":1744726164,\"endTime\":1744726182},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Knowledge and intelligence. And so like, like asking that same question of like, \",\"startTime\":1744726183,\"endTime\":1744726188},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"OK, now what? Because they have all these new tools, like what do we do next? \",\"startTime\":1744726188,\"endTime\":1744726192},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I think that''s really the critical question that we need to be. \",\"startTime\":1744726192,\"endTime\":1744726197},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm answering and attempting to answer. Umm, cause to your point it''s like there''s \",\"startTime\":1744726199,\"endTime\":1744726202},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"no clear right or wrong way to do that yet. \",\"startTime\":1744726202,\"endTime\":1744726206},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And so as, as the history teacher, like there''s, there''s definitely some comfort \",\"startTime\":1744726207,\"endTime\":1744726211},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"in knowing that like these problems in a way have have been seen before and we have to take lessons learned and apply them now because we''re faced with with similar challenges. So I, you know, really resonated with me what you said \",\"startTime\":1744726211,\"endTime\":1744726224},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"about your experience too. \",\"startTime\":1744726224,\"endTime\":1744726229},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Well I really appreciate it. You are an amazing learner and this is \",\"startTime\":1744726231,\"endTime\":1744726234},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"a wonderful way to start my day. \",\"startTime\":1744726234,\"endTime\":1744726237},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, likewise.\",\"startTime\":1744726237,\"endTime\":1744726240},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"All right, partner ready. Thanks.\",\"startTime\":1744726237,\"endTime\":1744726240},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, before we read the the card, I see it says end at the bottom. When we press \",\"startTime\":1744726240,\"endTime\":1744726245},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"end you''re done. It''s hanging up. That''s like hang up the call just for FYI. \",\"startTime\":1744726245,\"endTime\":1744726250},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726246,\"endTime\":1744726246},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"OK, OK, cool.\",\"startTime\":1744726248,\"endTime\":1744726249},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Umm so, uh, thank your partner and share one thing you''ve learned from them. \",\"startTime\":1744726252,\"endTime\":1744726255},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Mike, I wanna say thanks. And I learned from you that in ChatGPT, the projects, \",\"startTime\":1744726255,\"endTime\":1744726259},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I have like 3 folders now, but I''m not using them at all. I''m like, I, I just \",\"startTime\":1744726259,\"endTime\":1744726263},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"straight up on this. I''m trying a little bit, but like, wait, this isn''t and \",\"startTime\":1744726263,\"endTime\":1744726267},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I try to drag something, put it. \",\"startTime\":1744726267,\"endTime\":1744726270},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726268,\"endTime\":1744726269},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I learned today from you. Thank you so much for the the the bump moving forward. \",\"startTime\":1744726271,\"endTime\":1744726276},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But that you can have your threads in the project folder, but then you can ask for summaries in that project folder. That''s what I was hearing from you. \",\"startTime\":1744726276,\"endTime\":1744726285},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So thanks for sharing that and that you can use project folders to do that kind of stuff like, Oh my God, I gotta do that. \",\"startTime\":1744726285,\"endTime\":1744726291},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726286,\"endTime\":1744726287},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So thank you.\",\"startTime\":1744726291,\"endTime\":1744726292},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, of course.\",\"startTime\":1744726292,\"endTime\":1744726294},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And the one thing that like I, I think you just like really stuck with \",\"startTime\":1744726295,\"endTime\":1744726300},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"me. You were just saying about your experience and your story is like and oftentimes \",\"startTime\":1744726300,\"endTime\":1744726305},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"like in sort of like doing mode and action mode. \",\"startTime\":1744726305,\"endTime\":1744726310},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"You know, like I there are times where checking off boxes is like the first thing that comes to mind. It isn''t necessarily the people and the individual \",\"startTime\":1744726311,\"endTime\":1744726320},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"stories and like sort of the invitation. \",\"startTime\":1744726320,\"endTime\":1744726324},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"To the table for stuff, because we''ve been working a lot on our AI strategy and I''m starting to encounter the first layers of friction there. \",\"startTime\":1744726324,\"endTime\":1744726333},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"It''s, it''s gone beyond like, oh, this is a really nice tool that like, we''re gonna move, we''re moving on this stuff and umm. \",\"startTime\":1744726334,\"endTime\":1744726341},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Giving people the space to to, you know, voice those concerns and to feel vulnerable and to learn and to ask the questions like is am I going to lose my job? Like \",\"startTime\":1744726342,\"endTime\":1744726351},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"the answer is no, but we need to like be moving forward and thinking about these big questions. \",\"startTime\":1744726351,\"endTime\":1744726360},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Which is probably uncomfortable for a lot of people. That''s something that I \",\"startTime\":1744726360,\"endTime\":1744726366},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"learned today or really resonated with me. What you were saying today is sort \",\"startTime\":1744726366,\"endTime\":1744726371},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"of that invitation to the table and, you know, meeting people where they are. \",\"startTime\":1744726371,\"endTime\":1744726376},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Although it can be challenging with some of the.\",\"startTime\":1744726377,\"endTime\":1744726380},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"The stories that people craft to to sort of explain their thinking. But yeah. \",\"startTime\":1744726382,\"endTime\":1744726386},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It''s hilarious. Uh, all I can say now is that if you''re 2 years old, like your \",\"startTime\":1744726387,\"endTime\":1744726390},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"little one, uh, or you''re 200 years old or whatever it is, we''re gonna be able to live too soon. \",\"startTime\":1744726390,\"endTime\":1744726397},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"We''re human and that''s why, like, I have to keep boiling it down to it just like, oh, they''re human. Yep. We''re we''re humans and we''re learners. All right. \",\"startTime\":1744726398,\"endTime\":1744726403},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726400,\"endTime\":1744726400},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So that''s where it is. Oh, you''re going through that one. That''s what we all \",\"startTime\":1744726403,\"endTime\":1744726406},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yep, Yep.\",\"startTime\":1744726404,\"endTime\":1744726406},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"do as learners. Like, I have to keep like stepping back and going more meta \",\"startTime\":1744726406,\"endTime\":1744726409},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1744726408,\"endTime\":1744726408},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"and going, oh, yeah, you''re, you''re a learner. Oh, that''s why you''re acting \",\"startTime\":1744726409,\"endTime\":1744726412},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"that way. And I like how you called it the best. Or like getting uncomfortable. \",\"startTime\":1744726412,\"endTime\":1744726415},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1744726415,\"endTime\":1744726418},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726415,\"endTime\":1744726419},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Mike, this has been wonderful. I wanted to say a couple things. One, I''m on \",\"startTime\":1744726419,\"endTime\":1744726422},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"the back end. My role is to support the community and to facilitate conversations \",\"startTime\":1744726422,\"endTime\":1744726426},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726423,\"endTime\":1744726423},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"like this. \",\"startTime\":1744726426,\"endTime\":1744726429},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"You definitely have a ton of technology and expertise that the community needs. \",\"startTime\":1744726430,\"endTime\":1744726435},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And our hope would be is that you have more conversations with others to stimulate your own growth as you stimulate theirs. And I don''t know what else would happen. \",\"startTime\":1744726435,\"endTime\":1744726443},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726441,\"endTime\":1744726441},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I will say for me, I''m like, I''m gonna put in the e-mail that I''m gonna send you later. Hey, if you wanna meet to do like let''s plan on building out a timer \",\"startTime\":1744726443,\"endTime\":1744726451},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"and you wanted to do. \",\"startTime\":1744726451,\"endTime\":1744726455},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Put 20 minutes on a timer to just Co think and I''ll be your partner and I''ll just ask questions or I''ll do the the side work or whatever. I would be game \",\"startTime\":1744726456,\"endTime\":1744726465},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"for that. I would also love something similar to just brainstorm more about. \",\"startTime\":1744726465,\"endTime\":1744726469},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What we''re doing here at side by or just using other tools like.\",\"startTime\":1744726469,\"endTime\":1744726473},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Jeff, how do you use project folders to take and do XY and Z that you''re trying to get done? I would love that. Just specific work time with you at some point. \",\"startTime\":1744726473,\"endTime\":1744726482},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726478,\"endTime\":1744726479},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That was a big flashing red light and I put it on my paper here. So I want to \",\"startTime\":1744726482,\"endTime\":1744726486},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726484,\"endTime\":1744726484},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"say say thanks. And if there''s any questions about any of the stuff that''s happening \",\"startTime\":1744726486,\"endTime\":1744726490},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1744726487,\"endTime\":1744726488},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"at Side By or you just have feedback, We are building the app, Mike, and we have Diego now on team. \",\"startTime\":1744726490,\"endTime\":1744726498},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"They''re building the app and as you know, building apps and tech stuff is always fun and. \",\"startTime\":1744726499,\"endTime\":1744726505},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1744726502,\"endTime\":1744726502},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726505,\"endTime\":1744726505},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I won''t go down that rabbit hole, but we''re building and as we have, as we are doing things, you know, this is beta testing your, your or alpha testing for, for better use of words. \",\"startTime\":1744726507,\"endTime\":1744726518},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And any feedback or ideas or thoughts, feel free to send them my way. I''ll take \",\"startTime\":1744726518,\"endTime\":1744726521},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"care of them and pass them to the team or any of those things like oh wow this is really great. \",\"startTime\":1744726521,\"endTime\":1744726527},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726522,\"endTime\":1744726523},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Our hope would be is that through conversations like this, as you meet and match with other people. \",\"startTime\":1744726527,\"endTime\":1744726532},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That you get time to share about those tools and even what''s happening at side by and we''ll hear more from you like with your reflection and then we can take. \",\"startTime\":1744726533,\"endTime\":1744726542},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I don''t know what the right word is, but I call it creating a digital artifact for you. Hey, Mike, this is this is the summary of your reflection. This is \",\"startTime\":1744726543,\"endTime\":1744726549},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"the summary of your and Jeff''s reflection with key points and key ideas and really cool. \",\"startTime\":1744726549,\"endTime\":1744726556},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Quotes that you might want to keep for later and those will go into your dashboard and you''ll be able to search through those later and all of that. \",\"startTime\":1744726557,\"endTime\":1744726564},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But my point would be is that if you have a voice, please raise it. You''re welcome \",\"startTime\":1744726564,\"endTime\":1744726566},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"here to do so. \",\"startTime\":1744726566,\"endTime\":1744726568},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Thank you, Jeff. Now I appreciate all of that and.\",\"startTime\":1744726569,\"endTime\":1744726573},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, happy to kind of be a sounding board, umm, if you guys have questions or things you wanna run by or if, uh, same, same with like the working stuff, like happy to kinda chat about those ideas since, uh, sounds like we both have a lot on our plates. Umm, figuring out project management can be certainly challenging \",\"startTime\":1744726573,\"endTime\":1744726590},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726578,\"endTime\":1744726579},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"and uh, yeah, happy to further engage in the community. Umm, yeah, I, I love \",\"startTime\":1744726590,\"endTime\":1744726594},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"what you guys are doing. I think it''s really important that we keep human connection \",\"startTime\":1744726594,\"endTime\":1744726598},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"in this time. \",\"startTime\":1744726598,\"endTime\":1744726602},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And and so this is a great way to do it. So thank you.\",\"startTime\":1744726603,\"endTime\":1744726606},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Thank you. Have a wonderful day, Mike. Appreciate you tons. You''re \",\"startTime\":1744726607,\"endTime\":1744726609},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"amazing. Bye. \",\"startTime\":1744726609,\"endTime\":1744726611},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Thank you. Yeah, likewise. Take care.\",\"startTime\":1744726609,\"endTime\":1744726611}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.252025+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.252025+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 2001, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.222Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('2b6bd28f-f9c0-4ca7-9d31-9a99d85f71ce', 'c9d72e87-97e2-4131-bf2e-7298453c0e52', '138223', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Book that help me think about.\",\"startTime\":1745287230,\"endTime\":1745287233},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"The future, most interestingly, is Sapiens by the author Yuval Harari.\",\"startTime\":1745287233,\"endTime\":1745287237},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Sapiens is a historical look. It looks at like how we got to where we are and \",\"startTime\":1745287239,\"endTime\":1745287243},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"then kind of extrapolates where we might be going. \",\"startTime\":1745287243,\"endTime\":1745287247},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"It''s a fun read, so as you read it you''re like, it''s like stories you''ve heard before but told really clearly. \",\"startTime\":1745287250,\"endTime\":1745287255},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And what else?\",\"startTime\":1745287258,\"endTime\":1745287260},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"It''s really well written. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1745287262,\"endTime\":1745287263},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"It''s really odd about some pretty unintuitive but insightful things.\",\"startTime\":1745287266,\"endTime\":1745287271},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"So you''ll learn a lot by reading it.\",\"startTime\":1745287271,\"endTime\":1745287273},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And I suggested.\",\"startTime\":1745287274,\"endTime\":1745287276},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"I specifically this generative AI.\",\"startTime\":1745287291,\"endTime\":1745287293},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Moment is letting me do things in my class.\",\"startTime\":1745287293,\"endTime\":1745287296},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"That I used to do but work my tail off for, do them simply and also enable me to do things that I used to wish I could have done. \",\"startTime\":1745287297,\"endTime\":1745287305},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And by bringing down the bar so that they''re possible.\",\"startTime\":1745287306,\"endTime\":1745287309},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Umm, in my classroom I umm, kind of devised these 4 phases.\",\"startTime\":1745287331,\"endTime\":1745287335},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Where phase one was to try something yourself, just with your brain.\",\"startTime\":1745287335,\"endTime\":1745287339},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Phase two was use a static resource, phase three was talked to a peer, and phase 4 was. \",\"startTime\":1745287340,\"endTime\":1745287346},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And phase one or Phase 2 is the static resource. And the static resource just \",\"startTime\":1745287348,\"endTime\":1745287353},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"got way better, so we should not have to come to our peers as often. \",\"startTime\":1745287353,\"endTime\":1745287358},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"But still, sometimes we do. So I guess the interesting question I''d ask in today''s \",\"startTime\":1745287359,\"endTime\":1745287362},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"day and age is. \",\"startTime\":1745287362,\"endTime\":1745287365},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"At what level?\",\"startTime\":1745287365,\"endTime\":1745287366},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Do people need a peer and for what?\",\"startTime\":1745287366,\"endTime\":1745287368},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"My current problem of practice is how to.\",\"startTime\":1745287392,\"endTime\":1745287394},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Give people a chance to try the most current things.\",\"startTime\":1745287394,\"endTime\":1745287397},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"For less money.\",\"startTime\":1745287399,\"endTime\":1745287400}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.188977+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.188977+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 133, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.162Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('933f2d21-55cf-449c-af7f-449f33e8b0d6', '44d8b840-888f-4849-9111-b52ada8f4599', '137150', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"My name is Brittany Stevens and I am a special education teacher at the elementary school level. I currently am serving students in fourth and 2nd grade from a \",\"startTime\":1739925857,\"endTime\":1739925867},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"range of reading, writing, math, adaptive skills. \",\"startTime\":1739925867,\"endTime\":1739925871},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Social emotional learning and I am so happy to be here to introduce myself and get to know you guys. I am really hoping that Side By can help grow my professional \",\"startTime\":1739925871,\"endTime\":1739925882},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"network of incredible educators and fill my toolbox with awesome tools to help my students and my community around me. Some things that I am passionate about. \",\"startTime\":1739925882,\"endTime\":1739925893},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Is differentiation and special education as well as artificial intelligence and that technology integration to help our students? \",\"startTime\":1739925893,\"endTime\":1739925903},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Umm, I recently went to the AI conference in Seattle. That was earlier in February \",\"startTime\":1739925903,\"endTime\":1739925907},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"of 2025, and let me tell you, I learned so many cool tools. So I''m really excited \",\"startTime\":1739925907,\"endTime\":1739925911},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"to share about those tools with you guys. Another thing I''m really looking forward \",\"startTime\":1739925911,\"endTime\":1739925915},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"to is adopting those systems that are effective, that work in your classrooms or in your spaces and bringing them into my space to make those more effective in serving our students. \",\"startTime\":1739925915,\"endTime\":1739925927},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Another fun thing is that last year I worked down South. I''ve always worked \",\"startTime\":1739925928,\"endTime\":1739925933},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"in Washington, but I''ve been doing this for about four years now. \",\"startTime\":1739925933,\"endTime\":1739925937},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"My current caseload is 15 students.\",\"startTime\":1739925938,\"endTime\":1739925941},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Last year I had 45. At the end of the year I had a 63 IP meeting. So I''m very \",\"startTime\":1739925942,\"endTime\":1739925947},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"grateful to be here and I''m very grateful to learn from those who might be in my experience or in my issues and those who have never been in my shoes. And \",\"startTime\":1739925947,\"endTime\":1739925956},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"so I''m excited to be here and connect with you all. \",\"startTime\":1739925956,\"endTime\":1739925961},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"A question what is my stance on teaching? So currently my on February 18th 2025 \",\"startTime\":1739925989,\"endTime\":1739925995},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"my current stance on teaching I believe the role of teachers. \",\"startTime\":1739925995,\"endTime\":1739926001},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Is tremendous we wear so many hats we are mentors, we are coaches, we are teachers, we are sometimes counselors, we are sometimes parents and friends and. \",\"startTime\":1739926002,\"endTime\":1739926015},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"We wear so many hats in the teaching profession and I truly am just really honored and grateful to be here. I''ve always wanted to be a teacher and really developing \",\"startTime\":1739926017,\"endTime\":1739926025},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"those skills of wearing different hats to help support students. \",\"startTime\":1739926025,\"endTime\":1739926030},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So gratifying. So then when we move on to talking about what is the role of \",\"startTime\":1739926031,\"endTime\":1739926035},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"the learner and I think the answer to that question for me currently is in the question. \",\"startTime\":1739926035,\"endTime\":1739926043},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So I really truly believe that the role of the learner is to show up for their work. \",\"startTime\":1739926044,\"endTime\":1739926049},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"And learn and be open to that coaching and be open to that feedback and trying new things and. \",\"startTime\":1739926050,\"endTime\":1739926058},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Upskilling.\",\"startTime\":1739926060,\"endTime\":1739926061},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So I think.\",\"startTime\":1739926062,\"endTime\":1739926063},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Not only are they learning, but I''m learning alongside them and I think that''s a really great opportunity to really view like, what are they going through every day? \",\"startTime\":1739926065,\"endTime\":1739926072},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"What should change?\",\"startTime\":1739926073,\"endTime\":1739926074},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"In education I have, I remember growing up my mom told me education is kind of like a box and I have dyslexia and I have ADHD and I have sensory sensitivity disorder. And so growing up in the public school systems, I noticed that that \",\"startTime\":1739926077,\"endTime\":1739926093},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"box or finding that that school is really built for a typically developing individual. \",\"startTime\":1739926093,\"endTime\":1739926099},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"And I think what can change and should change is. \",\"startTime\":1739926099,\"endTime\":1739926104},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"What public school looks like, I do think we can adapt more. I think that those \",\"startTime\":1739926104,\"endTime\":1739926107},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"tools that help students with exceptionalities can be streamlined to help all students. So taking that box. \",\"startTime\":1739926107,\"endTime\":1739926115},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"And maybe changing the shape or even letting some of those walls down.\",\"startTime\":1739926115,\"endTime\":1739926119},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"And what should stay the same? Oh.\",\"startTime\":1739926121,\"endTime\":1739926123},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"What should stay the same? I just thought another thing I want to change is \",\"startTime\":1739926124,\"endTime\":1739926128},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"standardized testing. OK, So what should stay the same? I really like that there \",\"startTime\":1739926128,\"endTime\":1739926133},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"is opportunity for extracurriculars. There''s opportunity for movement through \",\"startTime\":1739926133,\"endTime\":1739926137},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"PEI. Really like that we are learning a variety of social, emotional and behavior \",\"startTime\":1739926137,\"endTime\":1739926141},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"and adaptive skills at school. I think that should we definitely need to keep \",\"startTime\":1739926141,\"endTime\":1739926145},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"that, especially with our integration of artificial intelligence. \",\"startTime\":1739926145,\"endTime\":1739926149},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Piling on social emotional skills I think is going to be really crucial moving forward. \",\"startTime\":1739926150,\"endTime\":1739926154},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"In my primary flow activity is currently doing yoga. I''m a huge peloton girly \",\"startTime\":1739926174,\"endTime\":1739926179},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"so riding my bike right now. It''s winter so I ride the peloton inside in the \",\"startTime\":1739926179,\"endTime\":1739926184},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"morning. I also really like journaling and reading. \",\"startTime\":1739926184,\"endTime\":1739926189},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Also dancing, yeah, those are my flow activities. Those always put me in a really \",\"startTime\":1739926190,\"endTime\":1739926192},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"good mood. \",\"startTime\":1739926192,\"endTime\":1739926194}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.210663+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.210663+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 308, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.192Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('9693673c-b47c-452d-a8a7-574cd6e54bca', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '137640', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"How do you? Can you hear me OK?\",\"startTime\":1741901548,\"endTime\":1741901550},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Howdy, I can. Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1741901550,\"endTime\":1741901553},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I was gonna walk down by the river, but it''s windy today here in Spokane, and I''m like, it''s gonna be too loud, so I''m gonna head to my truck. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1741901552,\"endTime\":1741901561},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Oh, next.\",\"startTime\":1741901561,\"endTime\":1741901561},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"I If the wind doesn''t bother me, I can''t hear any wind, wind noise from you. \",\"startTime\":1741901562,\"endTime\":1741901564},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"So if it doesn''t bother you, it doesn''t bother me. \",\"startTime\":1741901564,\"endTime\":1741901567},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Great, I just happened to be by a brick building so I''m in the little alcove. \",\"startTime\":1741901567,\"endTime\":1741901571},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Maybe this would be a good spot. I hear you guys are getting a couple feet of \",\"startTime\":1741901571,\"endTime\":1741901575},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"snow. At least that''s what the forecast said. \",\"startTime\":1741901575,\"endTime\":1741901578},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we we got a little bit of a snow, snow storm last night. I''m actually \",\"startTime\":1741901577,\"endTime\":1741901580},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"on a snow day today. \",\"startTime\":1741901580,\"endTime\":1741901582},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"So I''m sitting at home on my couch, but, uh, we only got about, we got less than a foot, uh, by school and over in Truckee, up on the, the tippy tops of the mountains, they got. \",\"startTime\":1741901582,\"endTime\":1741901593},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1741901594,\"endTime\":1741901594},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"2 1/2 feet. 2 to 2 1/2 feet.\",\"startTime\":1741901595,\"endTime\":1741901597},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"2 1/2 feet, That''s crazy.\",\"startTime\":1741901598,\"endTime\":1741901600},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Mike posted in Slack yesterday that the forecast, he said three feet, so whatever, he didn''t get it all. \",\"startTime\":1741901601,\"endTime\":1741901608},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK. Hey, it''s nice to meet you. Thanks for joining.\",\"startTime\":1741901609,\"endTime\":1741901611},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"This is cool. OK.\",\"startTime\":1741901613,\"endTime\":1741901614},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ve never done this before so I have no idea how I''m supposed to do this. \",\"startTime\":1741901613,\"endTime\":1741901616},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, we got you. Uh, on my screen it says greet your partner Jeff and \",\"startTime\":1741901617,\"endTime\":1741901620},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"then press more. \",\"startTime\":1741901620,\"endTime\":1741901623},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Icebreaker. OK, is your icebreaker say the same thing? If you could have a superpower \",\"startTime\":1741901624,\"endTime\":1741901628},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"related to AI, what would it be and why? \",\"startTime\":1741901628,\"endTime\":1741901632},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741901632,\"endTime\":1741901632},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, I''ll let you go. First, let me think about a superpower related to \",\"startTime\":1741901634,\"endTime\":1741901636},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1741901635,\"endTime\":1741901635},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"AI. \",\"startTime\":1741901636,\"endTime\":1741901638},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Umm, maybe.\",\"startTime\":1741901648,\"endTime\":1741901649},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"To be a super prompter.\",\"startTime\":1741901652,\"endTime\":1741901654},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Tell me more.\",\"startTime\":1741901655,\"endTime\":1741901656},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Like I, I always read and, and kind of try to keep up with the different ways that you can interact with AI to get better results and being able to not have to trial and error it and just kind of know what the the best outcome, the best input will get the best outcome. \",\"startTime\":1741901658,\"endTime\":1741901674},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"For what I''m trying to have it to.\",\"startTime\":1741901676,\"endTime\":1741901677},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Whoa, I like that. I find that same kind of thing.\",\"startTime\":1741901679,\"endTime\":1741901682},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Now your role. You''re a counselor, right?\",\"startTime\":1741901683,\"endTime\":1741901685},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1741901685,\"endTime\":1741901686},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"As soon as he started talking about that, it made me think about your your work as a counselor and how many years of experience and prompts that you''ve had with students and teachers and. \",\"startTime\":1741901687,\"endTime\":1741901696},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Count other counselors and admin about asking this and that and like you''re you''re probably a super prompter like epic proportions superpower when it comes to knowing the right questions to ask today with kids. \",\"startTime\":1741901697,\"endTime\":1741901708},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Compared to other educators? Probably. Compared to other educators? Probably, \",\"startTime\":1741901709,\"endTime\":1741901712},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"but probably not in the grander scheme of the the AI world. \",\"startTime\":1741901712,\"endTime\":1741901716},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, but I just was thinking like the human counterpart. That''s what it made \",\"startTime\":1741901718,\"endTime\":1741901721},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"me think of right away when you were talking like, oh, just a counselor. So \",\"startTime\":1741901721,\"endTime\":1741901724},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"prompting the AI tool. \",\"startTime\":1741901724,\"endTime\":1741901727},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"For me it feels like I just gotta work and spend more time doing it to get better. \",\"startTime\":1741901727,\"endTime\":1741901730},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But I''m with you, I I want that superpower too. Just to know what know what \",\"startTime\":1741901730,\"endTime\":1741901733},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to ask so that I get the the answers or the feedback that I need. \",\"startTime\":1741901733,\"endTime\":1741901737},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I don''t know, I definitely don''t like that frustration when you keep asking and just not figuring out what you''re wanting like. \",\"startTime\":1741901738,\"endTime\":1741901743},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''s obvious to me. Why don''t you know me? Because you''re smart. Yeah. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1741901744,\"endTime\":1741901749},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ve been playing with Lovable, with, you know, which MM actually showed me and introduced me to it, and I''ve been. \",\"startTime\":1741901749,\"endTime\":1741901756},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Playing around with that a little bit and that''s been fun. I''ve been for years. \",\"startTime\":1741901756,\"endTime\":1741901759},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"I, I used to have this great. \",\"startTime\":1741901759,\"endTime\":1741901762},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Time tracking tool that I would use but it was an excel based macro based thing that someone else built that no longer is maintained and so I''ve never I''ve never really been able to replicate. \",\"startTime\":1741901764,\"endTime\":1741901774},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"The tool that I, I, I really valued using ''cause it told me how I was spending my time. And so I''m using I, I started couple weeks ago using it to kinda create \",\"startTime\":1741901775,\"endTime\":1741901782},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"a, you know, a lovable app And, but, but on that note, it''s, it''s like, you know. \",\"startTime\":1741901782,\"endTime\":1741901789},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"With that tool.\",\"startTime\":1741901790,\"endTime\":1741901791},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Feels like sometimes you''re, you''re like, oh, this isn''t working the way I want it to. Let''s adjust it. And then you go and fix it and then it adjusts like \",\"startTime\":1741901792,\"endTime\":1741901797},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Nice.\",\"startTime\":1741901792,\"endTime\":1741901793},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"way more than you want it to or breaks another feature that you''re like, Oh no, I didn''t want you to touch that. \",\"startTime\":1741901797,\"endTime\":1741901803},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s funny. Umm, lovable. I have not played with it, but barely.\",\"startTime\":1741901804,\"endTime\":1741901809},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I don''t know all of the details, but I did hear this morning, Diego, he''s helping us out with tech stuff. He said he uses ChatGPT to chat about because \",\"startTime\":1741901810,\"endTime\":1741901819},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"he''ll often just ask a question. Lovable. \",\"startTime\":1741901819,\"endTime\":1741901824},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then it''s doing all these things. He''s like, no, I didn''t want to do all \",\"startTime\":1741901824,\"endTime\":1741901828},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"that. So he''s using another GPT to do his thinking and as a thinking partner \",\"startTime\":1741901828,\"endTime\":1741901832},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and then goes back to Lovable to do his prompts in there. I don''t know if that''s \",\"startTime\":1741901832,\"endTime\":1741901835},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"helpful for you or not, but that''s something that. \",\"startTime\":1741901835,\"endTime\":1741901839},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''ve been learning at times with different AI bots or tools that I''m building or working with end up having another window open for another tool to help me know like what kind of prompts or things so that it doesn''t get convoluted in there. \",\"startTime\":1741901839,\"endTime\":1741901852},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Is sometimes, yeah. It just does all these things like, no, no, stop, please \",\"startTime\":1741901854,\"endTime\":1741901857},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741901854,\"endTime\":1741901854},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"stop. Not, not what we wanted you to do. \",\"startTime\":1741901857,\"endTime\":1741901860},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK, I want I want my superpower for AI to be hot lava. I was trying to think \",\"startTime\":1741901862,\"endTime\":1741901867},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"of stuff. I''ve heard of some other ones from people lately. One was time stopping \",\"startTime\":1741901867,\"endTime\":1741901871},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"like freeze time and their their thing was their AI would freeze time for them so they could do all the things that they normally don''t get to do. I''m like, \",\"startTime\":1741901871,\"endTime\":1741901881},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"oh, I like that, but I''m going to go with hot lava because that sounds fun. \",\"startTime\":1741901881,\"endTime\":1741901885},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1741901884,\"endTime\":1741901885},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And for me, it''s the hot lava to melt through all of the barriers that we had for education. Like just like. \",\"startTime\":1741901887,\"endTime\":1741901894},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, you don''