ething and. \",\"startTime\":1741902182,\"endTime\":1741902189},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"It might be a fun way to utilize AI to enhance what I do with kind of kids and families. \",\"startTime\":1741902190,\"endTime\":1741902195},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome.\",\"startTime\":1741902197,\"endTime\":1741902197},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Now that you mentioned Lovable, Mike sent out a blurb about Lovable just giving some updates and upgrades. One of them has a feature that they''re integrating \",\"startTime\":1741902198,\"endTime\":1741902206},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"called Clerk, CLERK, Clerk. \",\"startTime\":1741902206,\"endTime\":1741902210},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I just started barely reading it before our our call started this morning, but it looks like a really cool like administrative panel and work to oversee some of that stuff. It''s like an assistant. I''m just speaking way beyond what \",\"startTime\":1741902212,\"endTime\":1741902226},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I read, but it looked to be something like that. \",\"startTime\":1741902226,\"endTime\":1741902231},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And so you''re talking about using it to help?\",\"startTime\":1741902232,\"endTime\":1741902234},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Do the work for parents and students and they can look the way that it looks. \",\"startTime\":1741902235,\"endTime\":1741902237},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''m wondering how lovable is going to continue with that. \",\"startTime\":1741902237,\"endTime\":1741902240},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"For you, helping to integrate the different advantages and perspectives of your your community because you got your students, you''ve got your teachers, you''ve got other staff administrator type of people. \",\"startTime\":1741902241,\"endTime\":1741902252},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Alright.\",\"startTime\":1741902251,\"endTime\":1741902251},{\"speaker\":\