speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Birds and coyotes and Bobcats and roadrunners and javelina and all sorts of crazy stuff going on around here. It''s cool. It''s really different. \",\"startTime\":1745272325,\"endTime\":1745272334},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Yeah, when you, when you''re gonna.\",\"startTime\":1745272332,\"endTime\":1745272333},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"When you get a chance you should go to the Pima Air Museum. There''s a cool.\",\"startTime\":1745272333,\"endTime\":1745272339},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh cool.\",\"startTime\":1745272341,\"endTime\":1745272342},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Thanks for the heads up on that.\",\"startTime\":1745272342,\"endTime\":1745272344},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Have you been down to the Tucson area much or?\",\"startTime\":1745272346,\"endTime\":1745272348},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Yeah, my sister lives down there, so we''ve done, they''ve gone down 3 or 4 times. \",\"startTime\":1745272348,\"endTime\":1745272352},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"So yeah. So when this turns great, does that mean we talk too long? \",\"startTime\":1745272352,\"endTime\":1745272356},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745272353,\"endTime\":1745272354},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Cool. Probably we need to change the timers on all of these. It''s funny we''re \",\"startTime\":1745272358,\"endTime\":1745272363},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745272362,\"endTime\":1745272362},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"we''re trying to see how upduo in the programming code connects people still and I looked on the lessons and. \",\"startTime\":1745272363,\"endTime\":1745272372},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And it said that you were ready for this lesson, but I guess I could repeat this lesson. Maybe I''ve done it before, but I was looking at lessons like, oh, \",\"startTime\":1745272373,\"endTime\":1745272378},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"this will be great. We''re going to get a cool tech lesson. But it gave us this \",\"startTime\":1745272378,\"endTime\":1745272381},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"one. \",\"startTime\":1745272381,\"endTime\":1745272383},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Still learning how to figure that out.\",\"startTime\":1745272384,\"endTime\":1745272385},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You''re part of the old crew like from original. So we''ve got some stuff to to \",\"startTime\":1745272386,\"endTime\":1745272390},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"figure out. But this is cool. But let''s let''s try with it. What''s something \",\"startTime\":1745272390,\"endTime\":1745272394},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"non work related that you''re learning or teaching about? \",\"startTime\":1745272394,\"endTime\":1745272398},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I am. Uh.\",\"startTime\":1745272399,\"endTime\":1745272401},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Learning how to grow oyster mushrooms. So yeah, I, I, I, I''ve been interested \",\"startTime\":1745272402,\"endTime\":1745272406},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"in it and then I. \",\"startTime\":1745272406,\"endTime\":1745272410},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"For Christmas, umm, my sister-in-law got me one of the preloaded UMM.\",\"startTime\":1745272413,\"endTime\":1745272418},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Blocks that you just draw them out of. And now I''m going to learn how to actually \",\"startTime\":1745272418,\"endTime\":1745272422},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"do the whole process so I have my kid at home, I just need to get the mycelium to put into it. How about you? \",\"startTime\":1745272422,\"endTime\":1745272430},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s way cool.\",\"startTime\":1745272432,\"endTime\":1745272433},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''m trying to draw more and doodle.\",\"startTime\":1745272435,\"endTime\":1745272438},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like just taking time to do that. I''m getting better at some doodling. They''re \",\"startTime\":1745272440,\"endTime\":1745272444},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"like not just like doodle doodles, but like here I''ll share with you, but like times to just get in flow state and just. \",\"startTime\":1745272444,\"endTime\":1745272452},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You know how it goes like if you have limited parameters like Jeff, use only three colors. And I keep it with me, my little my little notebook, it''s a teeny \",\"startTime\":1745272456,\"endTime\":1745272463},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"1. \",\"startTime\":1745272463,\"endTime\":1745272466},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And then what I''m doing in it is I''m trying to just take time to reflect on the day and. \",\"startTime\":1745272468,\"endTime\":1745272473},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''ve got some rules on how the doodle works.\",\"startTime\":1745272473,\"endTime\":1745272476},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, here''s one of them there.\",\"startTime\":1745272478,\"endTime\":1745272480},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"I''m crazy awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745272483,\"endTime\":1745272484},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745272484,\"endTime\":1745272485},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like, that was one after seeing these incredible rock formations that were just sticking up. Oh, it''s upside down. \",\"startTime\":1745272485,\"endTime\":1745272490},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"In the blue sky and the cactus everywhere.\",\"startTime\":1745272494,\"endTime\":1745272496},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"So they''re just closed loops that don''t crossover. And being able to go and \",\"startTime\":1745272497,\"endTime\":1745272501},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"come back and create shapes with it. It''s been really fun and good for my brain, \",\"startTime\":1745272501,\"endTime\":1745272505},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"good for my space. I don''t get to eat it. \",\"startTime\":1745272505,\"endTime\":1745272509},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, it''s a different place.\",\"startTime\":1745272509,\"endTime\":1745272511},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745272511,\"endTime\":1745272512},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, alright, ready for more?\",\"startTime\":1745272515,\"endTime\":1745272517},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"How did you end up becoming an educator? Uh.\",\"startTime\":1745272518,\"endTime\":1745272522},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Considering What did you Teach First? Where in the world were you?\",\"startTime\":1745272525,\"endTime\":1745272530},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"What was the experience like?\",\"startTime\":1745272530,\"endTime\":1745272533},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1745272534,\"endTime\":1745272535},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I was in Spokane and I first became an educator officially and professionally because it seemed like the right path for me. I was always connecting with other \",\"startTime\":1745272536,\"endTime\":1745272545},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"people and helping and tutoring and. \",\"startTime\":1745272545,\"endTime\":1745272549},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"My classmates that would be helping them when the teacher''s doing whatever lesson and then they would be asking questions, it''d be me and my friend, whoever was. \",\"startTime\":1745272550,\"endTime\":1745272558},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And I just always seemed to be like helping them out and put into those spots to help others. And so I found that that was the the space and place that I \",\"startTime\":1745272558,\"endTime\":1745272565},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"started flourishing and really finding, Dang it, I want to do something different because these teachers are doing a pretty crappy job and I want students and I want my kids to do a better job. There are some really cool teachers, but \",\"startTime\":1745272565,\"endTime\":1745272576},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"as a whole, I wasn''t seeing it. \",\"startTime\":1745272576,\"endTime\":1745272580},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And I wanted to make a difference. And then started officially at Ferris High \",\"startTime\":1745272582,\"endTime\":1745272585},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"School. That''s where I got my first gig. I had done some grad school work and \",\"startTime\":1745272585,\"endTime\":1745272589},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"some subbing, but landed at Ferris and it was kind of scary fun being young, 20s something, and got all these high school kids and they were taller and had more facial hair than I did. \",\"startTime\":1745272589,\"endTime\":1745272601},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Bigger and elevate, like how do you do this? So it was pretty fun. Yeah. How \",\"startTime\":1745272602,\"endTime\":1745272605},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"about you? \",\"startTime\":1745272605,\"endTime\":1745272608},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Umm, I started teaching, uh, my, my journey started a little bit later. I was \",\"startTime\":1745272611,\"endTime\":1745272615},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"working at the Coeur d''Alene resort and I was uh, intern there and umm, my mom was a physical therapist for the schools and her and all her teacher friends got him some rooms and uh, I kind of, umm. \",\"startTime\":1745272615,\"endTime\":1745272628},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Had this epiphany like, wow, all these people are like here in the summertime and they''re happy and they''re married and they are successful and they, they seem to have a pretty good life. And I was working where I was working. Everybody \",\"startTime\":1745272635,\"endTime\":1745272649},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"was divorced or on their third marriage or having affairs. And I was working \",\"startTime\":1745272649,\"endTime\":1745272654},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"from 3:00 in the afternoon till 11:00 at night. \",\"startTime\":1745272654,\"endTime\":1745272659},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Wednesday through Sunday. So I was kind of in this weird and I said well, what \",\"startTime\":1745272660,\"endTime\":1745272662},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"can I do? \",\"startTime\":1745272662,\"endTime\":1745272664},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"And like I I had tutored and coached and stuff, but then I kind of realized this is where I should be and. \",\"startTime\":1745272666,\"endTime\":1745272677},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"About the same time my wife, I met my wife and she was still going to school. \",\"startTime\":1745272679,\"endTime\":1745272684},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"So I went back and started doing my prereq stuff and I really enjoyed like the process of of learning and then teaching. But I think as I''ve become a teacher \",\"startTime\":1745272684,\"endTime\":1745272694},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"and then now that I''ve been doing it for. \",\"startTime\":1745272694,\"endTime\":1745272698},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Quite a while. I''ve learned to love it more each each year.\",\"startTime\":1745272702,\"endTime\":1745272707},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"And and, and kind of make it to make it better. I, I work with some teachers \",\"startTime\":1745272710,\"endTime\":1745272715},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"who are like, man, this job sucks. I can''t, I, I don''t like it anymore. \",\"startTime\":1745272715,\"endTime\":1745272719},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"And umm, I''m kind of opposite. Like the further I''m in the more.\",\"startTime\":1745272720,\"endTime\":1745272725},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"The more I think I can change it and make it better, so that''s kind of how I got there. \",\"startTime\":1745272728,\"endTime\":1745272733},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Way to go.\",\"startTime\":1745272732,\"endTime\":1745272733},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh dude, that''s awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745272735,\"endTime\":1745272737},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, I''m going to do a different question unless you want to answer this one. \",\"startTime\":1745272741,\"endTime\":1745272745},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"No, that''s fine.\",\"startTime\":1745272745,\"endTime\":1745272746},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh no, let''s do this first. What do you hope from these sessions now that it''s \",\"startTime\":1745272749,\"endTime\":1745272753},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"like new side by connecting you with other educators? I know it''s just Jeff \",\"startTime\":1745272753,\"endTime\":1745272757},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"time right now, but our focus is on AI and education and how educators are using AI. So specifically for you, Rob, what would you hoped that these sessions with \",\"startTime\":1745272757,\"endTime\":1745272765},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"other educators would would? \",\"startTime\":1745272765,\"endTime\":1745272769},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Do for you.\",\"startTime\":1745272770,\"endTime\":1745272771},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"I hope that I''m able to give some of the things that I have learned and how I''ve kind of, umm. \",\"startTime\":1745272772,\"endTime\":1745272780},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Pivoted and evolved into something a teacher that I think I would like to have had when I was in school. So I''m hoping to share with the other people and hopefully \",\"startTime\":1745272784,\"endTime\":1745272792},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"give them some insights and then just the same exact thing if if people are willing to. \",\"startTime\":1745272792,\"endTime\":1745272801},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Get on side by and learn from other people and teach. I hope that the people \",\"startTime\":1745272804,\"endTime\":1745272809},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"who I''m talking to have a similar viewpoint in terms of they have something cool that they''re doing and they want to share it. And so kind of I''ll kind \",\"startTime\":1745272809,\"endTime\":1745272817},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"of make the connection to like all the Tesla cars. So I went to I''m learning \",\"startTime\":1745272817,\"endTime\":1745272821},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"about like. \",\"startTime\":1745272821,\"endTime\":1745272825},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Well, I''m I''m kind of enjoying learning about robots and stuff right now.\",\"startTime\":1745272827,\"endTime\":1745272832},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"The new robots that are gonna be coming out, the self driving Tesla cars like they don''t have any sensors anymore. It''s all. \",\"startTime\":1745272832,\"endTime\":1745272840},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"All done with cameras in the AI analyzes the camera feeds and they record and share all their experiences with all the other Teslas who have ever driven. \",\"startTime\":1745272841,\"endTime\":1745272851},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"So they have like a billion miles of data that they''ve all learned from and they''re sharing that stuff with the new robots that are coming out So they''re going to have billions of hours of of data and learning that''s all simultaneously been being shared So that''s kind of what I''m looking at this like like if. \",\"startTime\":1745272851,\"endTime\":1745272871},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"There''s all these awesome resources and tools if we can get together and combine all of our ideas into something that is like. \",\"startTime\":1745272876,\"endTime\":1745272883},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"A shared brain, kind of, I don''t know if that''s the right word, but a shared community of, of knowledge that is fluidly shared amongst us. Kind of like those \",\"startTime\":1745272886,\"endTime\":1745272894},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"robots and cars are like every experience that they have, they share it and then everybody learns from it. \",\"startTime\":1745272894,\"endTime\":1745272903},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, OK. That''s that''s that''s a pretty good goal.\",\"startTime\":1745272907,\"endTime\":1745272909},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1745272909,\"endTime\":1745272910},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I love it. I love it, Rob. That''s my heartbeat too. And I love how you even \",\"startTime\":1745272911,\"endTime\":1745272914},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"said like that shared experience, that community knowledge. I''m hoping that \",\"startTime\":1745272914,\"endTime\":1745272917},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"for that same exact thing, that one, you get those one-on-one conversations which enrich you and that I get enriched. And I''ll tell you what, every time \",\"startTime\":1745272917,\"endTime\":1745272924},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I hear from people, you and other people, my brain is just tired afterwards because they help me think deeply. And then I find myself doing all these other \",\"startTime\":1745272924,\"endTime\":1745272930},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"things like, oh, I gotta learn how to use this tool better. I''m like, no, Jeff, \",\"startTime\":1745272930,\"endTime\":1745272934},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"stay unfocused. \",\"startTime\":1745272934,\"endTime\":1745272937},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"But I''m learning tons and I and I also have that secondary goal professionally is my own goal and I and for us as an organization. \",\"startTime\":1745272939,\"endTime\":1745272947},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And we would build that community shared knowledge so that we can be sharing more of the experience and lessons learned in the tidbits and those things. \",\"startTime\":1745272947,\"endTime\":1745272955},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"So that just like you said, like the knowledge of going down the road and what to avoid and what to do or what does this look like And what does it really \",\"startTime\":1745272955,\"endTime\":1745272962},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"mean that data that we would share that data for other people, those dispositions and the ways that we do things and think about things that we would share that in the community knowledge. And that will help us to become better to, to adapt \",\"startTime\":1745272962,\"endTime\":1745272973},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745272966,\"endTime\":1745272967},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"and to navigate those roads that are going to be in front of each of us. \",\"startTime\":1745272973,\"endTime\":1745272977},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Roads are gonna be different, just the reality.\",\"startTime\":1745272977,\"endTime\":1745272980},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and, and like I, I tell the kids like I''m old enough to wear the Internet didn''t exist when I was in elementary school. I mean, it might have existed, \",\"startTime\":1745272979,\"endTime\":1745272988},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"but it wasn''t accessible. And I, I go if I was doing a report before the Internet \",\"startTime\":1745272988,\"endTime\":1745272992},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"was out, I had to go to the library. There might be two books in the library \",\"startTime\":1745272992,\"endTime\":1745272996},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"that had. \",\"startTime\":1745272996,\"endTime\":1745273000},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"You know, few pages about my topic and there was an encyclopedia that I could use. There might be a a a movie I could watch but. \",\"startTime\":1745273003,\"endTime\":1745273011},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"My resources were limited to the what the teachers taught me and what I could find in the library once the Internet became available. \",\"startTime\":1745273012,\"endTime\":1745273019},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Now I can learn anything and it''s so massive and it''s so accessible. But, and, \",\"startTime\":1745273020,\"endTime\":1745273025},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"