\",\"text\":\"I just love what I do and I''m really grateful to be here today. I''m healthy, \",\"startTime\":1740788573,\"endTime\":1740788577},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I''m able to get to work because I''m under a good contract. And I''m really here \",\"startTime\":1740788577,\"endTime\":1740788581},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"talking about this conversation with you because we met at a conference. I loved \",\"startTime\":1740788581,\"endTime\":1740788585},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"your energy. I love how you brought people together who should know one another \",\"startTime\":1740788585,\"endTime\":1740788589},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"to just advance in this profession and in our knowledge base and. \",\"startTime\":1740788589,\"endTime\":1740788594},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I''m here because I value your input, I respect you as an individual, and I''m just really excited to continue learning from you and other great individuals and professionals around me. \",\"startTime\":1740788594,\"endTime\":1740788603},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wow, you have such a wonderful stance about learning. It''s magical to be around \",\"startTime\":1740788605,\"endTime\":1740788607},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1740788607,\"endTime\":1740788610},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You bring a great energy to the crew and to the people around you and.\",\"startTime\":1740788610,\"endTime\":1740788614},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''s amazing because you''re wanting to learn so much and you engage with the people around you and it''s wonderful. \",\"startTime\":1740788615,\"endTime\":1740788622},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1740788623,\"endTime\":1740788624},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I I''m here in doing the work that I''m doing because I enjoy working with people. \",\"startTime\":1740788623,\"endTime\":1740788628},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And at s