88687,\"endTime\":1740788690},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''m like, OK, I''m not in the classroom with kids. I''m in the classroom with \",\"startTime\":1740788690,\"endTime\":1740788694},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"adults. How do you do with adults? How do you use these routines to engage learners \",\"startTime\":1740788694,\"endTime\":1740788697},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and all of this stuff? And OK, how do you really facilitate meaningful discourse? \",\"startTime\":1740788697,\"endTime\":1740788700},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I don''t read and figure this out. And then I''m like, holy crap. \",\"startTime\":1740788700,\"endTime\":1740788703},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Write it.\",\"startTime\":1740788702,\"endTime\":1740788703},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Other tools in mic show me this tool and like we can do one-on-one conversations and not even be there in the room and trust them and you can facilitate meaningful discourse by having a few cars on the screen. How do you do that? \",\"startTime\":1740788705,\"endTime\":1740788717},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I love it. We can just dive in and get to all this good stuff.\",\"startTime\":1740788717,\"endTime\":1740788721},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. So I think it''s two reasons I''m here. One, I''m still on my quest \",\"startTime\":1740788722,\"endTime\":1740788726},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to facilitate meaningful discourse and I''m learning how to do it. I''m getting \",\"startTime\":1740788726,\"endTime\":1740788730},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"better at it because I love people. I love working with them. And I realize \",\"startTime\":1740788730,\"endTime\":1740788733},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1740788731,\"endTime\":1740788731},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it''s really important to let them do the talking and the learning and the the driving and the painting and all that stuff and to get o