e\":1740788949},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"of yourself. Remember, nobody else will, OK? \",\"startTime\":1740788951,\"endTime\":1740788953},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Thank you, Jeff. Have a good weekend. Bye, bye.\",\"startTime\":1740788954,\"endTime\":1740788957},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You''re welcome. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1740788956,\"endTime\":1740788957}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.882124+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.882124+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1428, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.842Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('ffbe89d7-ed50-4713-ad46-60afc77f5849', '1437c66b-ec40-4d5f-ae09-61eaf239da58', '137240', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I teach teachers to use AI so that they can teach their students to use AI.\",\"startTime\":1740437234,\"endTime\":1740437237},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"And.\",\"startTime\":1740437237,\"endTime\":1740437238},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I hope to learn about what''s changing as it changes.\",\"startTime\":1740437239,\"endTime\":1740437242},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Forward. Lean it forward whenever I find myself leaning too far back.\",\"startTime\":1740437256,\"endTime\":1740437258},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I remind myself to lean a little further forward.\",\"startTime\":1740437258,\"endTime\":1740437260},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Forward could means more student centrifuges. Forward could mean more skill. \",\"startTime\":1740437260,\"endTime\":1740437263},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Forward could mean. \",\"startTime\":1740437263,\"endTime\":1740437265},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Umm towards change towards technology umm forward could mean.\",\"startTime\":1740437267,\"endTime\":1740437270},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I don''t know.\",\"startTime\":1740437272,\"endTime\":1740437272},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I teach my kids to ski.\",\"startTime\":1740437288,\"endTime\":1740437289},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I like punk rock music. I like to ski off pieced, jump off of things.\",\"startTime\":1740437289,\"endTime\":1740437295}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.398238+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.398238+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 47, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:09.360Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('18d479ad-b7e5-45e7-a66a-6ca2c3230b46', '6591e553-8215-4832-843f-a15c716b5863', '137780', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Hello, just jumping in here to introduce myself and make sure I can match with a partner. Appreciate the ability to reflect. \",\"startTime\":1742588967,\"endTime\":1742588974},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"I am Erica and.\",\"startTime\":1742588976,\"endTime\":1742588979},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"That''s that.\",\"startTime\":1742588986,\"endTime\":1742588987},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"So I''m in reflecting and it''s says there''s three cards but I''m just on card 1. \",\"startTime\":1742588988,\"endTime\":1742588993},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"And it doesn''t move me to the next card until I''m through a minute. That''s interesting. \",\"startTime\":1742588995,\"endTime\":1742589000},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"So I can''t finish the reflection quickly if I want to, which could be a thing. \",\"startTime\":1742589004,\"endTime\":1742589009},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"But that''s interesting. Like I can see that there''s three. \",\"startTime\":1742589009,\"endTime\":1742589013},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"I could, I could just like X myself out, but I can''t. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1742589014,\"endTime\":1742589016},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"That''s interesting. It still did. So now I''ve hit my one minute.\",\"startTime\":1742589027,\"endTime\":1742589030}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.47678+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.47678+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 87, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:09.454Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('21440ed0-f089-45aa-8267-9141c741b804', 'f75f7f16-84b9-41ce-b842-2a77a9dd70b8', '138135', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Everyone, my name is Mike Peck. Uh, I''m a director of technology for a public \",\"startTime\":1744720857,\"endTime\":1744720860},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"school in Pennsylvania. I''m excited to. \",\"startTime\":1744720860,\"endTime\":1744720863},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Through Upduo and sci-fi get to meet other.\",\"startTime\":1744720863,\"endTime\":1744720866},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Educators like myself.\",\"startTime\":1744720867,\"endTime\":1744720869},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Who are interested in how we can leverage technology to enhance learning.\",\"startTime\":1744720869,\"endTime\":1744720874},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Outcomes and opportunities.\",\"startTime\":1744720875,\"endTime\":1744720877},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"So my stance with respect to teaching and learning, I prior to getting into technology leadership, I was the classroom educator. \",\"startTime\":1744720909,\"endTime\":1744720917},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And in that role?\",\"startTime\":1744720917,\"endTime\":1744720919},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Through the use of technology, I was really focused on how we can use the technology in a way that allows students to explore learning versus telling them how to learn. And so I focused a lot on project based learning and how we can learn \",\"startTime\":1744720921,\"endTime\":1744720938},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"through exploration and play. And this is going back to like 2007, 2008, 2009. \",\"startTime\":1744720938,\"endTime\":1744720944},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Where, you know, we were first seeing the initial like iPad rollouts and things like that. And So what I found was that students were much more interested in \",\"startTime\":1744720945,\"endTime\":1744720955},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"engaged in learning when they could actively explore it on their own and so. \",\"startTime\":1744720955,\"endTime\":1744720961},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"That said, about all sorts of exploration on my own part, looking into gamification. \",\"startTime\":1744720961,\"endTime\":1744720965},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Like I said, project based learning. \",\"startTime\":1744720965,\"endTime\":1744720969},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And then exploring new technologies and how they could really enhance teaching and learning. So my hope is new technologies can allow us to return to a place \",\"startTime\":1744720969,\"endTime\":1744720978},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"where educators can, can be, connectors can be, mentors can be. \",\"startTime\":1744720978,\"endTime\":1744720982},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, you know, supports versus being the thing that, that, uh, allows kids to learn. \",\"startTime\":1744720983,\"endTime\":1744720988},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And I think especially through the use of new technologies like AI that we''re gonna be able to get there. But we have to not just. \",\"startTime\":1744720989,\"endTime\":1744720997},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Think about teaching and learning. We need to think about the systems that undergird \",\"startTime\":1744720997,\"endTime\":1744720999},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"it. \",\"startTime\":1744720999,\"endTime\":1744721001},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I think umm.\",\"startTime\":1744721037,\"endTime\":1744721037},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I find myself most in a state of flow.\",\"startTime\":1744721037,\"endTime\":1744721041},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, when I''m engaging in sort of like passion projects. So certainly.\",\"startTime\":1744721043,\"endTime\":1744721046},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"With work, I like building stuff, planning things.\",\"startTime\":1744721047,\"endTime\":1744721051},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Executing on projects you know checking off the task list really gets me motivated. \",\"startTime\":1744721052,\"endTime\":1744721058},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Outside of work? Umm, I think uh.\",\"startTime\":1744721058,\"endTime\":1744721062},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, I think so. I would say first and foremost outside of work, umm, spending \",\"startTime\":1744721064,\"endTime\":1744721067},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"time with my, my son who''s 2, uh. \",\"startTime\":1744721067,\"endTime\":1744721071},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"He''s incredible and you know, I could spend hours and hours just kind of playing and talking and doing things with him. \",\"startTime\":1744721072,\"endTime\":1744721080},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Spending time with my family, both my my immediate family, my extended family. \",\"startTime\":1744721082,\"endTime\":1744721088},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Those things are really exciting for me and umm, and sports too, so I''m pretty active athlete, umm, still uh. \",\"startTime\":1744721088,\"endTime\":1744721095},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Somehow find my time to play.\",\"startTime\":1744721096,\"endTime\":1744721099},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Soccer, quite a bit, golfing are my 2 favorites and and so yeah, those are the things that I really enjoyed, you know, spending time on outside of work. \",\"startTime\":1744721099,\"endTime\":1744721108}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.263643+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.263643+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 198, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.229Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('b67134b3-70be-4675-ad42-6ca8e4557038', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '137153', '"[{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Hey, Tom, good morning. Happy hot tea to you.\",\"startTime\":1739982512,\"endTime\":1739982515},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1739982529,\"endTime\":1739982529},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, you glitched out for just a second that I agree. Your partner Tom \",\"startTime\":1739982530,\"endTime\":1739982534},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"and press more for the icebreaker. \",\"startTime\":1739982534,\"endTime\":1739982537},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You could have a superpower related to AI. What would it be and why? Oh.\",\"startTime\":1739982540,\"endTime\":1739982545},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Well, one of my super powers that I''ve always wished I had would be to be able to freeze time. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1739982552,\"endTime\":1739982558},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So, umm.\",\"startTime\":1739982562,\"endTime\":1739982563},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Is there a way to like?\",\"startTime\":1739982564,\"endTime\":1739982566},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like freeze time would be.\",\"startTime\":1739982568,\"endTime\":1739982570},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"For AI to.\",\"startTime\":1739982572,\"endTime\":1739982574},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Daily scan my calendar, tell me which things it''s got. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1739982575,\"endTime\":1739982581},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And tell me how much time I just gained and then I can.\",\"startTime\":1739982583,\"endTime\":1739982587},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Fill it with stuff that I would do if I could freeze time.\",\"startTime\":1739982590,\"endTime\":1739982593},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Am I hearing you like the superpower would be is the AI power tool would be to integrate with your calendar to help free up more space so that you would be able to do stuff like time or frozen? \",\"startTime\":1739982596,\"endTime\":1739982609},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yes, exactly.\",\"startTime\":1739982611,\"endTime\":1739982612},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, I like that. I really like that.\",\"startTime\":1739982615,\"endTime\":1739982617},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I think for me it would be similar but it''s more of time management.\",\"startTime\":1739982620,\"endTime\":1739982625},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"In my brain I have all of these, even kindergarten visuals of Jeff''s health and well-being. And the bars would be going up and down for the different areas \",\"startTime\":1739982627,\"endTime\":1739982635},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that Jeff got exercised. Jeff slept well, Jeff ate good food. Things that Jeff \",\"startTime\":1739982635,\"endTime\":1739982640},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"doesn''t manage really well in his life at times. \",\"startTime\":1739982640,\"endTime\":1739982644},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"But he''s happy when he''s got all of those buckets filled and the bars are reaching critical levels of happiness and getting the tea and walking about having good conversations. So for me, the superpower would be is like the automated. \",\"startTime\":1739982644,\"endTime\":1739982660},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I don''t know the heads up display of like Jarvis from Iron Man showing me how my oxygen levels are, but in all of the areas and and give me recommendations and help schedule out. Jeff, go for a walk and do a up duo chat with Tom a side \",\"startTime\":1739982662,\"endTime\":1739982674},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1739982669,\"endTime\":1739982670},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1739982671,\"endTime\":1739982672},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"by chat with Tom while you''re going for a walk. Remember your ear buds. And \",\"startTime\":1739982674,\"endTime\":1739982678},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"then it would show me that this is getting my my health and well-being meter up. \",\"startTime\":1739982678,\"endTime\":1739982687},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And scheduling out a ski date with with a friend and then make sure you''re doing art time to get in flow and to do your meditation and just let go of the other stuff and give your brain some space to think deeply. \",\"startTime\":1739982688,\"endTime\":1739982703},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739982690,\"endTime\":1739982691},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like, yeah, it''d be like the kindergarten mom for a little Jeff.\",\"startTime\":1739982703,\"endTime\":1739982707},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Integrated into my system. Oh I like.\",\"startTime\":1739982708,\"endTime\":1739982711},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, by the way, what is your, what''s your art?\",\"startTime\":1739982710,\"endTime\":1739982713},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Creating.\",\"startTime\":1739982716,\"endTime\":1739982717},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I love woodworking, first of all. It''s been a passion for a long time and of \",\"startTime\":1739982717,\"endTime\":1739982720},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"late I''ve been doodling. \",\"startTime\":1739982720,\"endTime\":1739982723},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"As a matter of fact, since I can walk about, I''ll show you my current doodle. \",\"startTime\":1739982725,\"endTime\":1739982729},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Welcome to our world.\",\"startTime\":1739982733,\"endTime\":1739982734},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''ll even put the light on.\",\"startTime\":1739982734,\"endTime\":1739982736},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"See if you can see it.\",\"startTime\":1739982741,\"endTime\":1739982742},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"It''s a line art technique that a friend shared with me and I''ve been morphing it and I like that. \",\"startTime\":1739982744,\"endTime\":1739982752},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739982746,\"endTime\":1739982747},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Use chalk in a medium and put a timer on it. So 5 minutes or 20 minutes or 15 \",\"startTime\":1739982752,\"endTime\":1739982757},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"minutes and then just doodle and do my drawings. So currently I''ve been doing \",\"startTime\":1739982757,\"endTime\":1739982762},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"landscapes and trying to embody what I see in the world and I find that even a 5 minute doodle on the chalkboard knowing that that''s all I have, that''s my canvas. If that''s the. \",\"startTime\":1739982762,\"endTime\":1739982778},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Microwave timer or whatever is cooking in the oven and I got 1520 minutes. I \",\"startTime\":1739982779,\"endTime\":1739982782},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"just put it on and that''s all I get. \",\"startTime\":1739982782,\"endTime\":1739982786},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And just get some space in there and.\",\"startTime\":1739982786,\"endTime\":1739982788},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That''s my current artwork.\",\"startTime\":1739982789,\"endTime\":1739982790},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Thanks for asking.\",\"startTime\":1739982792,\"endTime\":1739982794},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I want to hit next. Oh, you beat me to it, ''cause it says partner ready.\",\"startTime\":1739982795,\"endTime\":1739982799},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, ask Tom.\",\"startTime\":1739982802,\"endTime\":1739982803},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"What recent AI innovation announced in the last week? Who did you find the most \",\"startTime\":1739982804,\"endTime\":1739982809},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"exciting? So if you didn''t hear in the last week, just in general? \",\"startTime\":1739982809,\"endTime\":1739982815},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm, in the last week I heard about, learned about, and then played around with the, uh, ChatGPT, deep research. \",\"startTime\":1739982817,\"endTime\":1739982827},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Well, you played with it.\",\"startTime\":1739982829,\"endTime\":1739982830},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Tell me about it, I just read that it came out.\",\"startTime\":1739982831,\"endTime\":1739982833},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I with another guy who I''m just sort of like thinking and dreaming with. We \",\"startTime\":1739982836,\"endTime\":1739982841},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"both went on and went through this series of prompts about starting a new, innovative high school in Denver. \",\"startTime\":1739982841,\"endTime\":1739982851},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And you know, kind of research then it like it went deep into like here''s some funding, here''s structures, here''s. \",\"startTime\":1739982854,\"endTime\":1739982861},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like all these different?\",\"startTime\":1739982862,\"endTime\":1739982863},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"It was 27 pages of like, really kind of good.\",\"startTime\":1739982867,\"endTime\":1739982871},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Stuff that you could put in front of a board and they''d be like, whoa, you''ve really thought about this? \",\"startTime\":1739982871,\"endTime\":1739982876},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That sounds like a magic time stop machine.\",\"startTime\":1739982879,\"endTime\":1739982881},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s crazy.\",\"startTime\":1739982883,\"endTime\":1739982884},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"But I also I graduated to pay versions.\",\"startTime\":1739982887,\"endTime\":1739982892},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"For both ChatGPT and Claude.\",\"startTime\":1739982895,\"endTime\":1739982899},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like I said, I graduated. What gave you the impetus to graduate?\",\"startTime\":1739982901,\"endTime\":1739982905},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm, it was. It was interest. Just like if I am the the kind of the person who \",\"startTime\":1739982910,\"endTime\":1739982915},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"is the future''s thinker at my organization. \",\"startTime\":1739982915,\"endTime\":1739982921},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And I''m a huge fan of AI and I use it all the time.\",\"startTime\":1739982922,\"endTime\":1739982926},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I just wanted to learn what the difference was. Lakeside school in Seattle there. \",\"startTime\":1739982927,\"endTime\":1739982933},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Do you track them or do you know anyone there or?\",\"startTime\":1739982935,\"endTime\":1739982937},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"We had a couple people come to the AI Summit. We were in Seattle, Tacoma area \",\"startTime\":1739982939,\"endTime\":1739982943},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"2 weeks ago, first week of February and there were a few people there from Lakeside, so I got to meet with them but I don''t have any deep connections at the moment there. \",\"startTime\":1739982943,\"endTime\":1739982954},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So their director of tech is this guy Jamie Britto.\",\"startTime\":1739982954,\"endTime\":1739982957},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Who is an amazing thinker and you 2 are?\",\"startTime\":1739982959,\"endTime\":1739982962},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Absolutely kindred spirits in a lot of ways. So that''s like an interesting connection. \",\"startTime\":1739982965,\"endTime\":1739982971},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"They are offering paid ChatGPT to every student and faculty member. \",\"startTime\":1739982971,\"endTime\":1739982978},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1739982982,\"endTime\":1739982983},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And so just sort of talking with him, seeing what they''re thinking about, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1739982982,\"endTime\":1739982987},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, super cool thing that we''ve been doing and it was fun even at just similar. \",\"startTime\":1739982991,\"endTime\":1739982997},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I don''t want to go too far off topic here, but this just reminds me that at the AI Summit, we were able to give three people who are in the session with Mike and I as about how do you, how do you keep up with AI in the next decade? \",\"startTime\":1739982997,\"endTime\":1739983012},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And at side by, even at the, the main page at side by, there''s a opportunity for people to sponsor educators and we had 19 sponsorships available so that we could give. \",\"startTime\":1739983012,\"endTime\":1739983027},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Sponsorships and paid subscriptions. So three people in a session, we were giving \",\"startTime\":1739983029,\"endTime\":1739983034},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"play time and they were exploring and using tools and as Mike said it, hey, when you reach a barrier and it''s a paywall barrier, let us know we happen to have sponsorships. So three people got. \",\"startTime\":1739983034,\"endTime\":1739983048},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Either a ChatGPT plus or access to lovable and and I think the other one was ChatGPT plus also or maybe Claude but. \",\"startTime\":1739983048,\"endTime\":1739983058},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Teachers have that as a barrier and it''s great to hear at Lakeside that they''re removing that barrier for them and that side by some groups are saying, hey, we want to support and what what could we do to support? And we know that one \",\"startTime\":1739983058,\"endTime\":1739983069},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"of the things is to provide access for people to. \",\"startTime\":1739983069,\"endTime\":1739983073},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Get their paid subscriptions so that they can use the tools and drive this super cool ship. \",\"startTime\":1739983073,\"endTime\":1739983079},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That they''re at, they'