\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"and different ways of thinking from other people and hear about their ideas? \",\"startTime\":1739984009,\"endTime\":1739984013},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And did you feel like you had the the place and space? \",\"startTime\":1739984013,\"endTime\":1739984018},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And felt like you belong to share your thinking so that others valued your contributions as well. Like if you had that, then then I''m just wondering like one-on-one \",\"startTime\":1739984019,\"endTime\":1739984029},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"conversations or even reflections, self reflections for the the learners to get that data to feed into the system that you''re talking about so that you get feedback as an educator. And then you would go, oh, holy crap, little Jeff \",\"startTime\":1739984029,\"endTime\":1739984044},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"is feeling like you took this pencil away. \",\"startTime\":1739984044,\"endTime\":1739984049},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, Tom took his pencil away. That''s what he said. And why don''t you \",\"startTime\":1739984050,\"endTime\":1739984053},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"give him the pencil, Tom? And then Jeff feels like he belongs and he''s at the \",\"startTime\":1739984053,\"endTime\":1739984056},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"controls. And then you can help support him or like you said. \",\"startTime\":1739984056,\"endTime\":1739984060},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You''ve been telling me the same thing over and over again. It''s not working. \",\"startTime\":1739984061,\"endTime\":1739984064},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like you don''t need to tell me 20 more times the same thing. \",\"startTime\":1739984064,\"endTime\":1739984068},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And what if so this is like a like a question about the back end or like how things work, but also like as a way to riff on your idea. \",\"startTime\":1739984068,\"endTime\":1739984078},{\"sp