 can be different, the story can be different, but the learning target is is consistent. So our craft becomes like getting laser focused on. \",\"startTime\":1743017425,\"endTime\":1743017432},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017429,\"endTime\":1743017431},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Like what''s the actual goal here? What do I actually hope? \",\"startTime\":1743017432,\"endTime\":1743017435},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"That the kids in the room come out with given the flexibility of like I don''t care if the the questions about motorcycles or about gardening, but it''s but it''s focused on this direction. Yeah, cool. Yeah, I hear you. \",\"startTime\":1743017436,\"endTime\":1743017448},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017440,\"endTime\":1743017440},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017446,\"endTime\":1743017447},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"It''s harder in history with that because we have such specific content, but my my friend across the hall who teaches English, she has much more flexibility because it''s more skill based and she has started to leverage some of those things because it is. \",\"startTime\":1743017448,\"endTime\":1743017466},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017454,\"endTime\":1743017454},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah, not too. Yeah, for sure.\",\"startTime\":1743017463,\"endTime\":1743017464},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"A greater skill base than a content base, but.\",\"startTime\":1743017469,\"endTime\":1743017473},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I also don''t want to take it in a sense where we are.\",\"startTime\":1743017476,\"endTime\":1743017480},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Then only letting the AI teach.\",\"startTime\":1743017481,\"endTime\":1743017485},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So one of the things that I then will pull from this.\",\"startTime\":1743017486,\"endTime\":1743017491},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Is they have to then reflect on their experience and I ask ChatGPT or Copilot. \",\"startTime\":1743017491,\"endTime\":1743017497},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"It does not work well in Gemini. Gemini has not figured that out yet. \",\"startTime\":1743017497,\"endTime\":1743017502},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"But then I asked the kids to reflect, and then I have them share about their stories, whether in an individual group or a group of four or as the whole class. \",\"startTime\":1743017505,\"endTime\":1743017514},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So that we get a perspective because.\",\"startTime\":1743017514,\"endTime\":1743017517},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Their adventures are so different.\",\"startTime\":1743017518,\"endTime\":1743017520},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"But yet it helps reinforce what they''re learning and getting back to that learning target. \",\"startTime\":1743017521,\"endTime\":1743017527},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017523,\"endTime\":1743017524},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And since teaching each other seems to be more effective in terms of like pedagogy and crap and I. \",\"startTime\":1743017528,\"endTime\":1743017536},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I mean it''s useful, but sometimes I dislike the the traditional.\",\"startTime\":1743017537,\"endTime\":1743017542},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I''m not a traditional teacher, so it doesn''t sound like, you know, that''s great. \",\"startTime\":1743017545,\"endTime\":1743017548},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I''m interrupting because of the peer teaching thing is like most of my life is built on it. When I was I was using like 10 years ago data from Khan Academy \",\"startTime\":1743017550,\"endTime\":1743017557},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"to connect a kid who was struggling with a skill to a kid who had mastered that exact skill. \",\"startTime\":1743017557,\"endTime\":1743017561},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And every week they would have a new partner to get like data-driven peer teaching. \",\"startTime\":1743017561,\"endTime\":1743017564},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Like it was authentically like it was awesome. Yes. And and this kind of like \",\"startTime\":1743017564,\"endTime\":1743017568},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"It''s amazing.\",\"startTime\":1743017566,\"endTime\":1743017567},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"we''re doing, we''re doing it here, I guess as as professional educators. But \",\"startTime\":1743017568,\"endTime\":1743017571},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017571,\"endTime\":1743017571},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"yeah, I''m super with you. \",\"startTime\":1743017571,\"endTime\":1743017574},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I was talking in front of the class. Isn''t is it? Isn''t it? No matter how fun \",\"startTime\":1743017575,\"endTime\":1743017578},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"it might be something. \",\"startTime\":1743017578,\"endTime\":1743017580},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017579,\"endTime\":1743017580},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I don''t know. That''s too exhausting for me. We''re on a block schedule. I haven''t \",\"startTime\":1743017582,\"endTime\":1743017584},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"got the energy for 80 minutes in front of kids. \",\"startTime\":1743017584,\"endTime\":1743017587},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"100%, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017588,\"endTime\":1743017589},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Not four times a day.\",\"startTime\":1743017589,\"endTime\":1743017590},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah, blah blah blah blah blah blah. No hear you.\",\"startTime\":1743017591,\"endTime\":1743017594},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And so I guess we''re, we''re kinda aligning on like this balance of like using the technology where it''s right, but then also making sure that the community of the cla