heir opinions from out there, like how are other districts doing it or what are people finding out? Or you might already have some opinion. You want to \",\"startTime\":1743017822,\"endTime\":1743017827},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"make sure that we all know what you''re thinking about. So like sharing what \",\"startTime\":1743017827,\"endTime\":1743017830},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"you''re learning and yeah. \",\"startTime\":1743017830,\"endTime\":1743017833},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I haven''t quite gotten that far. I honestly hadn''t really thought about how \",\"startTime\":1743017836,\"endTime\":1743017840},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"other. \",\"startTime\":1743017840,\"endTime\":1743017844},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Places are using it because I don''t know that there''s been a lot of conversation about that, and that''s simply been what I found in research. So I didn''t even \",\"startTime\":1743017845,\"endTime\":1743017854},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"come here expecting that. \",\"startTime\":1743017854,\"endTime\":1743017858},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I would get other ideas in that sense about how other districts are doing it. \",\"startTime\":1743017858,\"endTime\":1743017862},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017864,\"endTime\":1743017864},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I I think I''m looking for more ways that I can show.\",\"startTime\":1743017866,\"endTime\":1743017870},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"How we can use this in the future because this is what our kids are going to be using. \",\"startTime\":1743017873,\"endTime\":1743017881},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And.\",\"startTime\":1743017883,\"endTime\":1743017883},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017883,\"endTime\":1743017884},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Like anything else, we need to educate them on how to use it effectively and appropriately. So I''m kind of here for all of 