 just like for, for the things I''m missing, for the perspectives that \",\"startTime\":1743017955,\"endTime\":1743017957},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I, I didn''t even know that I didn''t know. \",\"startTime\":1743017957,\"endTime\":1743017960},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Umm, and it''s a great meeting. Yeah, yeah. And for the conviction, like the \",\"startTime\":1743017961,\"endTime\":1743017964},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017962,\"endTime\":1743017963},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"talk shot with someone else, like this is fun. Like at this at a skier, like, \",\"startTime\":1743017964,\"endTime\":1743017967},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"yeah, yeah, this is fun. This is this is working. Our kids''ll kids dig it. It''s \",\"startTime\":1743017967,\"endTime\":1743017970},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"It is fun.\",\"startTime\":1743017969,\"endTime\":1743017970},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"actually helping people. \",\"startTime\":1743017970,\"endTime\":1743017973},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And how do we help people go a little faster? Like the ski analogy? I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1743017975,\"endTime\":1743017978},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"apologize over and over again for staying in in that for so long. But people \",\"startTime\":1743017978,\"endTime\":1743017982},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"are there traversing or they''re dropped in when you''re skiing, you''re they''re like going to cross the mountain or, or straight down the mountain. \",\"startTime\":1743017982,\"endTime\":1743017988},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And the more we''re like we call like ski the hypotenuse, if we''re just kind of traversing down the mountain, we''re not having as much fun. So for myself \",\"startTime\":1743017989,\"endTime\":1743017996},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"to get a little more conviction to drop in fully and for to help other people have the conviction to drop in fully and it''s like keep going. This works. \",\"startTime\":1743017996,\"endTime\":1743018003},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yup. No.\",\"startTime\":1743017996,\"endTime\":1743017996},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Is is a big part of the reasons.\",\"startTime\":1743018004,\"endTime\":1743018005},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Love it. Yeah, I skate a lot when I was in Wisconsin. There''s not much in Indiana \",\"startTime\":1743018006,\"endTime\":1743018010},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"other than. I mean, granted we had ice snow in Wisconsin anyway, but here it \",\"startTime\":1743018010,\"endTime\":1743018014},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"is. Nope. Keep me away. It''s not even worth it. \",\"startTime\":1743018014,\"endTime\":1743018019},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Right on.\",\"startTime\":1743018023,\"endTime\":1743018024},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Also thank you I I concretely learned that.\",\"startTime\":1743018026,\"endTime\":1743018030},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I guess the teacher skill would be like using Lexile level as a proxy for.\",\"startTime\":1743018030,\"endTime\":1743018036},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Language proficiency.\",\"startTime\":1743018037,\"endTime\":1743018039},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I think I''m gonna take that with me for sure. And then tactically or technology, \",\"startTime\":1743018039,\"endTime\":1743018042},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"technologically that I can use something like like PowerPoint to do it. \",\"startTime\":1743018042,\"endTime\":1743018046},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I, I just, I''m excited that.\",\"startTime\":1743018052,\"endTime\":1743018054},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743018052,\"endTime\":1743018052},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Like you and I seem to have a a very similar take on.\",\"startTime\":1743018056,\"endTime\":1743018060},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Things and I feel like that makes it much mo