ker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Oh, I have been learning how to write poetry. I''ve been. Yeah, it''s been awesome. \",\"startTime\":1741725097,\"endTime\":1741725101},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Like, I got into like, somatic therapy and it''s all about feeling your feelings in your body. And so I found that, like, metaphors have been so helpful for \",\"startTime\":1741725101,\"endTime\":1741725111},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"that and trying to process it through writing. \",\"startTime\":1741725111,\"endTime\":1741725115},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I love that. That''s way cool. I need to get back to my writing. That''s a skill \",\"startTime\":1741725116,\"endTime\":1741725120},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"that I''ve been working on but I put aside for some reason, but I have been working on. I want to hear so much more about your poems. Would you share one with me \",\"startTime\":1741725120,\"endTime\":1741725128},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"sometime just for if you want to? Yeah, that would be really fun. Like to hear \",\"startTime\":1741725128,\"endTime\":1741725132},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"more about it. And then by the way, in the background on your board, are those \",\"startTime\":1741725132,\"endTime\":1741725136},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, awesome. What are you? Oh.\",\"startTime\":1741725133,\"endTime\":1741725136},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"like Nets for things to fold together or are they just. Yeah. What grade do \",\"startTime\":1741725136,\"endTime\":1741725140},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you teach? What grade do you work with again? \",\"startTime\":1741725140,\"endTime\":1741725144},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725143,\"endTime\":1741725144},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Middle school math.\",\"startTime\":1741725145,\"endTime\":1741725146},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK, that''s what I was thinking. Like that''s about the right time, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725146,\"endTime\":1741725150},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yep, Sir.\",\"startTime\":1741725150,\"endTime\":1741725151},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Skill for me is saying no to more things. I''m learning to say no and be more \",\"startTime\":1741725152,\"endTime\":1741725156},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"balanced and not overextend which is. \",\"startTime\":1741725156,\"endTime\":1741725161},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s a hard.\",\"startTime\":1741725160,\"endTime\":1741725162},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, this adulting thing, I just want to do everything.\",\"startTime\":1741725163,\"endTime\":1741725166},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"And the balance of productivity versus like self-care, but not also being stagnant, like it''s so hard to find the middle line. \",\"startTime\":1741725167,\"endTime\":1741725174},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Exactly, exactly. You know what? Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725174,\"endTime\":1741725177},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Totally. OK then if I click XI think or next.\",\"startTime\":1741725177,\"endTime\":1741725181},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Alright.\",\"startTime\":1741725181,\"endTime\":1741725181},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Next.\",\"startTime\":1741725183,\"endTime\":1741725184},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"OK, next. Oh, it''s a.\",\"startTime\":1741725184,\"endTime\":1741725186},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Now mine says partner ready so I''m gonna put next. OK. If you press next before \",\"startTime\":1741725186,\"endTime\":1741725191},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I do then it will say partner ready on mine versus yours. \",\"startTime\":1741725191,\"endTime\":1741725197},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1741725192,\"endTime\":1741725192},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s a That''s a good feature. I like that.\",\"startTime\":1741725196,\"endTime\":1741725198},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And also, if you wanted to go back, you can always press back. So then it will \",\"startTime\":1741725199,\"endTime\":1741725203},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"say your partner wants to go back or you''re waiting for your partner, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1741725203,\"endTime\":1741725206},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I gotcha. I like this. This is so cool. OK.\",\"startTime\":1741725206,\"endTime\":1741725209},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, you get to drive it with a partner instead of just a reflection, All right? \",\"startTime\":1741725209,\"endTime\":1741725213},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Ask Haley. How has AI changed your work as an educator or leader of educators \",\"startTime\":1741725213,\"endTime\":1741725218},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Right or.\",\"startTime\":1741725215,\"endTime\":1741725216},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"so far? \",\"startTime\":1741725218,\"endTime\":1741725223},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yep, and then ask Jeff to add more. OK, so it has reduced my workload and makes \",\"startTime\":1741725224,\"endTime\":1741725229},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"this profession feel manageable. Like it, I have a thought partner constantly \",\"startTime\":1741725229,\"endTime\":1741725234},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"and instead of spending five hours like creating scaffolding for a lesson, I can do it in 5 minutes. And so it helps me reach kids but then also like have \",\"startTime\":1741725234,\"endTime\":1741725244},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"a work life balance. \",\"startTime\":1741725244,\"endTime\":1741725249},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome. That''s awesome. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1741725250,\"endTime\":1741725253},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, how are you?\",\"startTime\":1741725252,\"endTime\":1741725253},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Well, I''m I''m supposed to ask or look for considered tools or platforms you''ve used? \",\"startTime\":1741725255,\"endTime\":1741725260},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And think about efficiency impact improvements and then reflect on on changes in student engagement. So because I''m asking you the question, I''m being mindful \",\"startTime\":1741725260,\"endTime\":1741725268},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"that. So I''m curious, what tools are you using to help do that? Like you talked \",\"startTime\":1741725268,\"endTime\":1741725273},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"about scaffolds, like what tools are you doing? \",\"startTime\":1741725273,\"endTime\":1741725277},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Colleague for sure, right ''cause that''s who who I''m with and everything. But \",\"startTime\":1741725278,\"endTime\":1741725282},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I have found that it''s just so helpful with best practices and stuff. So often \",\"startTime\":1741725282,\"endTime\":1741725287},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"times I''ll say like make a student facing graphic organizer with sentence stems and a word bank and then I''ll type in like. \",\"startTime\":1741725287,\"endTime\":1741725296},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Speed and MLL, that''s all I have to say. And then it''ll like revise it so it \",\"startTime\":1741725296,\"endTime\":1741725300},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"has pictures, cognitive dictionaries, like all the things. \",\"startTime\":1741725300,\"endTime\":1741725304},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"And umm, it''s cool ''cause I have a printer in my room, so if something''s not working I''ll just be like, this didn''t work, I need this. Instead, print it \",\"startTime\":1741725304,\"endTime\":1741725309},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"off and give it to the kids. \",\"startTime\":1741725309,\"endTime\":1741725311},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wow, that''s awesome. What are you noticing for impact with students?\",\"startTime\":1741725314,\"endTime\":1741725319},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725315,\"endTime\":1741725316},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Engagement has increased a lot.\",\"startTime\":1741725319,\"endTime\":1741725321},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I, I used to teach 4th grade and I looped up with my kids. So the 8th graders \",\"startTime\":1741725324,\"endTime\":1741725328},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I''ve had, I''ve had since COVID and yeah, it''s been great, but it''s. \",\"startTime\":1741725328,\"endTime\":1741725332},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I noticed so much resistance when they hit middle school because of like being perceived by their peers. \",\"startTime\":1741725333,\"endTime\":1741725339},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"And yesterday I had them like come up to the board to do math, which I shifted away from because of the resistance. And they were again willing, like they \",\"startTime\":1741725339,\"endTime\":1741725346},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"were in fourth and 5th grade, to like talk in front of their peers because they felt more confident. \",\"startTime\":1741725346,\"endTime\":1741725352},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hmm, wow, way to go. Nice job. Really nice.\",\"startTime\":1741725354,\"endTime\":1741725359},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1741725355,\"endTime\":1741725356},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"So proud of them.\",\"startTime\":1741725358,\"endTime\":1741725359},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, mine just said ask Haley so.\",\"startTime\":1741725360,\"endTime\":1741725362},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Let me go back to see what mine said. OK, then ask Jeff to add to your answer. \",\"startTime\":1741725363,\"endTime\":1741725366},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"So. \",\"startTime\":1741725366,\"endTime\":1741725370},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh OK, add to your answer I guess that''s my perspective. Oh I like what you \",\"startTime\":1741725370,\"endTime\":1741725375},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"said. Like what used to take hours, now it takes minutes. \",\"startTime\":1741725375,\"endTime\":1741725379},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Doing some things like.\",\"startTime\":1741725380,\"endTime\":1741725382},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Like it''s fun that you were saying about math and doing scaffolding for work. \",\"startTime\":1741725382,\"endTime\":1741725387},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"With Dale Berry, who''s over in Madison, WI, we created an AI assistant that focuses on special education, but from Washington''s perspective. \",\"startTime\":1741725387,\"endTime\":1741725398},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"According to Washington''s OSPI guidelines around menus of best practices and their their inclusionary practices report, We took all of that and put it in and created an AI bot as an assistant. And we''re using it to do things so slightly \",\"startTime\":1741725399,\"endTime\":1741725414},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1741725400,\"endTime\":1741725402},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"as you said, but then it''s it''s has from the knowledge base because I find that. \",\"startTime\":1741725414,\"endTime\":1741725419},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Each of the, or each of us has bias. It''s just built in. It''s, it''s our perspective \",\"startTime\":1741725419,\"endTime\":1741725424},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"on it. And so whether it''s Gemini or Copilot or ChatGPT or Perplexity or Cloud \",\"startTime\":1741725424,\"endTime\":1741725428},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"or whoever''s out there, they all have their, their knowledge base. And so Dale \",\"startTime\":1741725428,\"endTime\":1741725433},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"was helpful for me to think about. \",\"startTime\":1741725433,\"endTime\":1741725438},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"How do we really make sure that the knowledge base is?\",\"startTime\":1741725438,\"endTime\":1741725442},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Based on the right stuff, so that the bias is biased towards what Washington state knows is best for inclusionary practices, the stance that our state has in mind for that. And so using tools like that to be able to do like, OK, now \",\"startTime\":1741725442,\"endTime\":1741725454},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725451,\"endTime\":1741725453},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"let''s go ahead and do. \",\"startTime\":1741725454,\"endTime\":1741725458},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"How do we adapt this lesson 7th grade math lesson from molester to mathematics? \",\"startTime\":1741725458,\"endTime\":1741725463},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"By the way, illustrative mathematics stuff is epic good and it''s publicly available. \",\"startTime\":1741725463,\"endTime\":1741725467},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So even in the Chat GPTI can just say 7th grade unit 4 lesson 7 and it will go find it for me the whole lesson. I only have to upload it now. Yeah, at least \",\"startTime\":1741725467,\"endTime\":1741725476},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725469,\"endTime\":1741725470},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I can ChatGPT and that saves so much time because then I can have a lesson from a good knowledge base and help minimize the bias that we don''t want and elevate the biases. \",\"startTime\":1741725476,\"endTime\":1741725488},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"That''s amazing and even.\",\"startTime\":1741725477,\"endTime\":1741725479},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725481,\"endTime\":1741725481},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That we do want.\",\"startTime\":1741725489,\"endTime\":1741725490},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. And it''s like using the lessons that they give you and stuff. So \",\"startTime\":1741725490,\"endTime\":1741725494},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I guess that''s the right way to say it, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725491,\"endTime\":1741725493},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"that''s so helpful where it''s just like already there and then build on top of it kind of thing. \",\"startTime\":1741725494,\"endTime\":1741725501},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, exactly.\",\"startTime\":1741725502,\"endTime\":1741725503},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, I changed my work totally that way. And then.\",\"startTime\":1741725505,\"endTime\":1741725509},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725506,\"endTime\":1741725507},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Another one, which has been epic, is having recording of my own reflections or conversation with somebody. I can let go of so many details of trying to \",\"startTime\":1741725509,\"endTime\":1741725517},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"take notes because I can''t get it all down, and I can enjoy the conversation or enjoy the time of reflection and just hit record and then take it in the transcript and make the notes and do the things that I need to with it later. \",\"startTime\":1741725517,\"endTime\":1741725529},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That''s been super helpful. \",\"startTime\":1741725529,\"endTime\":1741725533},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Do you use a free app?\",\"startTime\":1741725532,\"endTime\":1741725533},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"My phone I got a Google pixel last year and it has built in transcription software with it. But I have really liked Otter. I''ve tried and played with a few different \",\"startTime\":1741725535,\"endTime\":1741725544},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"ones but Otter and I pay for the subscription because I really like it. \",\"startTime\":1741725544,\"endTime\":1741725549},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I like it ''cause I can integrate it with my Google Meet or my calendar meetings if I have a online meeting. But I can just have the app on my phone and I just \",\"startTime\":1741725550,\"endTime\":1741725558},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"press record. And I like it because it shows a live transcription. So I can \",\"startTime\":1741725558,\"endTime\":1741725562},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1741725562,\"endTime\":1741725563},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"just look back real quickly ''cause I get lost in a detail and then I go, what was the thing that she just said? Haley mentioned What tool? \",\"startTime\":1741725562,\"endTime\":1741725570},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725570,\"endTime\":1741725571},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"''Cause I was thinking and processing the other stuff and then I can just skim right up and go, oh, that''s what it was called. She said she used that and so. \",\"startTime\":1741725571,\"endTime\":1741725577},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"No, and it looks like it says start here for free. So I think that there is \",\"startTime\":1741725578,\"endTime\":1741725581},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"a free option. \",\"startTime\":1741725581,\"endTime\":1741725584},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and I like the free option and I know that you can do certain things for free with it. And then I know the paid version, you can upload videos or audio \",\"startTime\":1741725583,\"endTime\":1741725591},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and then have it transcribe or do different things. \",\"startTime\":1741725591,\"endTime\":1741725596},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Remember, I should see about going to the free version. Maybe that''s all I need \",\"startTime\":1741725597,\"endTime\":1741725600},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"now. Yeah, yeah. But I really, really, really love that one, especially on Mana \",\"startTime\":1741725600,\"endTime\":1741725603},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1741725603,\"endTime\":1741725604},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Drive, coming back from a school district or whatever, and I or I''m going for a walk. \",\"startTime\":1741725603,\"endTime\":1741725609},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Put my earbuds in, I could just reflect and talk about the stuff that''s going on and then it''s got it. And then I have it and I can put it into my GPT assistant \",\"startTime\":1741725610,\"endTime\":1741725618},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725611,\"endTime\":1741725612},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and ask it, hey, what are we doing today? Or put this together, write my poem \",\"startTime\":1741725618,\"endTime\":1741725622},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"for me or, or whatever. \",\"startTime\":1741725622,\"endTime\":1741725625},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725624,\"endTime\":1741725625},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, OK, We''re gonna get way off topic. I know we could talk all day. I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1741725626,\"endTime\":1741725628},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I love.\",\"startTime\":1741725626,\"endTime\":1741725627},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"press next. \",\"startTime\":1741725628,\"endTime\":1741725631},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Next, go take turns sharing with Jeff. How do you think AI will change the role \",\"startTime\":1741725631,\"endTime\":1741725635},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"of learners in the future? Press more for ideas, personalized learning experience, \",\"startTime\":1741725635,\"endTime\":1741725639},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"AI tutors and assistants and learning analytics and personalized feedback. OK, \",\"startTime\":1741725639,\"endTime\":1741725643},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"you go first because I''ve been going first last two. \",\"startTime\":1741725643,\"endTime\":1741725648},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I think the role of learners is going to become more creators and problem solvers, and we have to really dial those parts up, even clear communicators, because the prompts that we use, there''s no perfect prompt. \",\"startTime\":1741725650,\"endTime\":1741725665},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"As you''ve probably found like when you''re talking to it, it makes sense in your brain, but then it doesn''t understand it the way you thought. You''re like, I \",\"startTime\":1741725666,\"endTime\":1741725672},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725670,\"endTime\":1741725671},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"didn''t mean that way. \",\"startTime\":1741725672,\"endTime\":1741725673},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And we have to become more articulate in our thinking and expressing our ideas and about problem solving. I think these, these tools are really tools. They, \",\"startTime\":1741725673,\"endTime\":1741725682},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725674,\"endTime\":1741725675},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"they are AI assistance for us to, to problem solve and to create things like, hey, how do I adapt and find the scaffolding for this lesson so I can enjoy my time with my kids. And I don''t spend so much time doing it. But I think we''ll \",\"startTime\":1741725682,\"endTime\":1741725696},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"have to become better problem solvers as learners. \",\"startTime\":1741725696,\"endTime\":1741725701},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Students and adults alike.\",\"startTime\":1741725703,\"endTime\":1741725705},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All of us as learners, we have to become better problem solvers and think about how do we solve these problems and what are the right tools to use and what are the right prompts to ask. Not like the perfect prompt, but what do I really \",\"startTime\":1741725705,\"endTime\":1741725714},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"want to ask? \",\"startTime\":1741725714,\"endTime\":1741725718},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Kind of like when we were first using Google and learning about Google searches, there''s different ways that you can get good results. So similarly, how do we \",\"startTime\":1741725718,\"endTime\":1741725725},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"use these AI tools to get the results that can help us move forward in in our work? \",\"startTime\":1741725725,\"endTime\":1741725732},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Hmm, Yeah, yeah, it definitely makes me think about communication and learning how to like articulate and your thoughts and ask the right questions, you know? \",\"startTime\":1741725731,\"endTime\":1741725741},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"So then if you''re practicing that with a chat bot or AI and stuff, then you comes out in human interactions as well. \",\"startTime\":1741725741,\"endTime\":1741725751},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Umm, but for AI and education, it makes me think about equity. And I''ve always \",\"startTime\":1741725751,\"endTime\":1741725756},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"taught in title one schools. And so it''s you don''t need as many resources, right? \",\"startTime\":1741725756,\"endTime\":1741725761},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725758,\"endTime\":1741725758},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Like in that cost money. And I think like any barriers to access to curriculum \",\"startTime\":1741725761,\"endTime\":1741725766},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"or knowledge, the kids like don''t have those barriers anymore because they can just chat with ChatGPT or whatever. And so it just opens up a whole new world \",\"startTime\":1741725766,\"endTime\":1741725775},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"of information. \",\"startTime\":1741725775,\"endTime\":1741725780},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love it.\",\"startTime\":1741725782,\"endTime\":1741725783},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725783,\"endTime\":1741725783},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But it really helps, helps with those equity issues. It provided that they have \",\"startTime\":1741725784,\"endTime\":1741725787},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Internet and a device that can get on and they have access to one of those AI tools. Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1741725787,\"endTime\":1741725794},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I just the free version, you know, and stuff. And I, it''s so funny ''cause \",\"startTime\":1741725793,\"endTime\":1741725797},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"when I started it, kids didn''t have access to Internet, computers, home or whatever. \",\"startTime\":1741725797,\"endTime\":1741725801},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"And now it''s ''cause I''ve been Title 1 urban or suburban setting. So it rules \",\"startTime\":1741725801,\"endTime\":1741725804},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"different. But it''s like most kids have a cell phone at home with Internet and \",\"startTime\":1741725804,\"endTime\":1741725808},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"stuff. \",\"startTime\":1741725808,\"endTime\":1741725812},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725813,\"endTime\":1741725814},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then by middle school, they''re having more access to it. Yeah, that''s for \",\"startTime\":1741725814,\"endTime\":1741725818},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Good, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725817,\"endTime\":1741725820},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"sure. Anything else about the role of learners in the future? \",\"startTime\":1741725818,\"endTime\":1741725822},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I think that they will be taking ownership of being the holders of the knowledge instead of relying so much on the teacher to tell them. \",\"startTime\":1741725826,\"endTime\":1741725834},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Because they that it''s one question away to access the knowledge versus I don''t know how to do this and I need my teacher to teach me. \",\"startTime\":1741725836,\"endTime\":1741725843},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"So they''ll take more ownership of their learning, I think.\",\"startTime\":1741725843,\"endTime\":1741725846},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hmm nice nice. Tell me more umm about ownership of that knowledge and learning. \",\"startTime\":1741725847,\"endTime\":1741725852},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''m curious what you mean by that ''cause I think I''m getting it in the aspect of they''re not just turning to the teacher for the answer or the teacher to how to do it, but what what makes them the owner and not the GPT the owner. \",\"startTime\":1741725852,\"endTime\":1741725865},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725856,\"endTime\":1741725857},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725862,\"endTime\":1741725862},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, so I think that there''s a line kinda to go, ''cause I see kids where it''s just like, give me the answer and then they write down what the answer is. But \",\"startTime\":1741725865,\"endTime\":1741725873},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I think that it naturally is kind of sparking curiosity because they''ll have that extra time of like, what do I do in class now? And so it may not always \",\"startTime\":1741725873,\"endTime\":1741725881},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"be the learning objective that they''re, you know, getting the knowledge for from that, but I''ve seen a lot of kids just play with it and like, oh, look, it makes diagrams. Oh, look at this. And they''ve kind of. \",\"startTime\":1741725881,\"endTime\":1741725894},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Create. It''s almost like Montessori vibes, right? Where they like go down their \",\"startTime\":1741725895,\"endTime\":1741725897},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"own path that they''re interested in. \",\"startTime\":1741725897,\"endTime\":1741725900},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Got it. Got it. So they''re directing their their experience more than they would \",\"startTime\":1741725902,\"endTime\":1741725905},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"they would otherwise. So that makes them the owners of their knowledge and their \",\"startTime\":1741725905,\"endTime\":1741725908},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"experience, is that what you''re saying? \",\"startTime\":1741725908,\"endTime\":1741725911},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And yeah. And autonomy makes them like buy in more.\",\"startTime\":1741725909,\"endTime\":1741725914},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, I like it. I like it. Yeah. There''s something magical about being behind \",\"startTime\":1741725916,\"endTime\":1741725919},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"the driver''s wheel. \",\"startTime\":1741725919,\"endTime\":1741725921},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yes, definitely.\",\"startTime\":1741725921,\"endTime\":1741725923},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725924,\"endTime\":1741725925},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, I like it, Yeah. So I think that role of being a learner is it will.\",\"startTime\":1741725925,\"endTime\":1741725930},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Require increased autonomy.\",\"startTime\":1741725932,\"endTime\":1741725934},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"As as you''re saying and ownership that we will be the ones making the decisions driving the the the ship or the boat behind the wheel. And we are the ones who \",\"startTime\":1741725935,\"endTime\":1741725943},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"as learners get to move it left and right, up and down, more gas, more brakes, more steering, whatever it would be that we would be at the controls. Yeah, \",\"startTime\":1741725943,\"endTime\":1741725951},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I think so too. \",\"startTime\":1741725951,\"endTime\":1741725955},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, I like that metaphor.\",\"startTime\":1741725955,\"endTime\":1741725958},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh thanks, I''ve been playing with it for a bit here in my brain.\",\"startTime\":1741725958,\"endTime\":1741725962},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725961,\"endTime\":1741725961},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK oh that''s interesting. I didn''t know that before if I tapped.\",\"startTime\":1741725963,\"endTime\":1741725966},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I made the box go down the dialogue box somehow.\",\"startTime\":1741725968,\"endTime\":1741725970},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Oh, oh, OK, yes, I was going to ask that if there was a feature because it''s cover, it was covering half your face. But now I just tap the screen, OK. \",\"startTime\":1741725971,\"endTime\":1741725980},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s it. Just tap the screen. I tap there. Thank you. I didn''t know that. \",\"startTime\":1741725980,\"endTime\":1741725985},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Read the chapter.\",\"startTime\":1741725981,\"endTime\":1741725982},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I should have shared that with the OR I should have. I should have shared something \",\"startTime\":1741725985,\"endTime\":1741725989},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"No, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725986,\"endTime\":1741725988},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I didn''t know. Thanks, Haley. No, I know know something I wish past Jeff could \",\"startTime\":1741725989,\"endTime\":1741725993},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"have shared with I was I was chatting with somebody, Lori, and she had that same thing ''cause I, I hold it too close to my face. \",\"startTime\":1741725993,\"endTime\":1741726001},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, it''s OK. I have it up against a water bottle.\",\"startTime\":1741726002,\"endTime\":1741726006},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s a good idea.\",\"startTime\":1741726006,\"endTime\":1741726007},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Let''s.\",\"startTime\":1741726007,\"endTime\":1741726007},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK, that''s better. OK, I press next. So I''m waiting for partner.\",\"startTime\":1741726010,\"endTime\":1741726015},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"So OK, thank your partner and share one thing you learned from them today.\",\"startTime\":1741726016,\"endTime\":1741726021},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Thank you for meeting with me. I think I''ve just, I mean, every time I interact \",\"startTime\":1741726023,\"endTime\":1741726027},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"with you, I''m learning the value of like social interactions again and again and again because it''s not my default. \",\"startTime\":1741726027,\"endTime\":1741726035},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"To be.\",\"startTime\":1741726037,\"endTime\":1741726038},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Pulled towards, I''d rather just like be in my classroom by myself kind of thing. \",\"startTime\":1741726039,\"endTime\":1741726042},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"And there''s always so much value in it. So just getting out of your comfort \",\"startTime\":1741726042,\"endTime\":1741726045},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"zone and talking to people. \",\"startTime\":1741726045,\"endTime\":1741726048},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, thanks. I really appreciate that.\",\"startTime\":1741726050,\"endTime\":1741726052},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And thank you, Haley, for time together. And I learned that it''s really efficient \",\"startTime\":1741726052,\"endTime\":1741726057},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to do things like asking for scaffolding. \",\"startTime\":1741726057,\"endTime\":1741726061},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"For your students and then even if it''s not working, you got a printer right there and you could just go like thinking about right now and how to do it and also. \",\"startTime\":1741726062,\"endTime\":1741726070},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741726066,\"endTime\":1741726067},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"The Somatics.\",\"startTime\":1741726073,\"endTime\":1741726074},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Or that what you''re talking about for poetry?\",\"startTime\":1741726075,\"endTime\":1741726077},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then helping to just process it with our emotions in that somatic, like what''s in our body, what''s going on here and thinking about that and how to express I''m just like you helped pique my interest into that. \",\"startTime\":1741726078,\"endTime\":1741726089},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So I would say fully learned it, but you''ve, you''ve helped me open my eyes to that, that notion of I guess I''ve learned that there''s something very embody about not just our emotions, which are in our head, but the whole body aspect and how we can express it through poetry and how healthy that can be. So thank \",\"startTime\":1741726089,\"endTime\":1741726105},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1741726090,\"endTime\":1741726090},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you for that. \",\"startTime\":1741726105,\"endTime\":1741726109},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, awesome. Yeah, No, I''m, I''ve always appreciate our talks together.\",\"startTime\":1741726110,\"endTime\":1741726114},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, you''re welcome. You''re welcome. I love him too. Thank you so much. After \",\"startTime\":1741726114,\"endTime\":1741726118},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"this, when you, by the way, when you press end, it''s end. And then you can do \",\"startTime\":1741726118,\"endTime\":1741726121},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a you can do a little message to me if you want to at the end. But I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1741726121,\"endTime\":1741726125},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"work. I''ll take our transcript. I get to see the video and transcript and I''ll \",\"startTime\":1741726125,\"endTime\":1741726129},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1741726127,\"endTime\":1741726127},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"put some artifacts for you into your dashboard at side by. So go to go to your \",\"startTime\":1741726129,\"endTime\":1741726132},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"my side by and then I''ll match you up because we''ve been matched. I''ll match \",\"startTime\":1741726132,\"endTime\":1741726136},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you with somebody else and you guys can figure out a time to connect for your next one. \",\"startTime\":1741726136,\"endTime\":1741726143},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You wanted to have more social time and there''s so many amazing other people out there and I''m thinking of some other cool people who are specialists in in MTSS and the work that they do there and that might be super fun. \",\"startTime\":1741726144,\"endTime\":1741726156},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Or just other geeky math teachers. I have a couple in mind. You would love them \",\"startTime\":1741726156,\"endTime\":1741726159},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741726157,\"endTime\":1741726158},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and they would love you. \",\"startTime\":1741726159,\"endTime\":1741726161},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s awesome. Oh my gosh. I''m so thankful. Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1741726162,\"endTime\":1741726165},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You''re welcome. Thank you, Haley. Have a wonderful, wonderful day. Appreciate \",\"startTime\":1741726165,\"endTime\":1741726167},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you. \",\"startTime\":1741726167,\"endTime\":1741726170}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.471301+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.471301+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1121, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.437Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('3dd2651b-472d-4482-9dfd-3eee7116b30f', '4c3a7dc1-10fb-45d6-a20e-f89f0e73af73', '137333', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Hello, can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1740769514,\"endTime\":1740769516},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Hi, Michael. Yes, I can.\",\"startTime\":1740769515,\"endTime\":1740769516},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1740769516,\"endTime\":1740769517},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"OK, sorry I was I can yes, I I was trying to trying to get logged in and I kept like getting in the app and getting it like refreshed and nothing was coming. \",\"startTime\":1740769516,\"endTime\":1740769523},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I''m like. \",\"startTime\":1740769523,\"endTime\":1740769526},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I thought it would like to come up there and whatnot, so.\",\"startTime\":1740769527,\"endTime\":1740769530},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740769530,\"endTime\":1740769531},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Now I found you have to press like the the enter button and then magically you get paired with your partner and yeah. \",\"startTime\":1740769532,\"endTime\":1740769539},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740769538,\"endTime\":1740769541},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"So what kind of role do you have at your school?\",\"startTime\":1740769542,\"endTime\":1740769545},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"I am an MTSS coordinator at my school so I''m working a lot with social, emotional behavior and academics for all students in the school and supporting my teachers and. \",\"startTime\":1740769546,\"endTime\":1740769556},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Meeting Tier 1, Tier 2 and Tier 3 supports. How about yourself?\",\"startTime\":1740769558,\"endTime\":1740769561},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"OK cool. I am a digital learning coordinator in a for a whole district.\",\"startTime\":1740769562,\"endTime\":1740769570},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh awesome.\",\"startTime\":1740769567,\"endTime\":1740769568},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Umm so I''m in Raleigh, NC if you ever if you''ve in the area, umm we, we have 200 schools in our county. \",\"startTime\":1740769571,\"endTime\":1740769580},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh, nice, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740769575,\"endTime\":1740769577},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh wow.\",\"startTime\":1740769581,\"endTime\":1740769581},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"So I, I support about 25 schools. So if there''s anyone in the school that needs \",\"startTime\":1740769582,\"endTime\":1740769587},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"help with like, you know, anything technology like digital learning technology, not like, you know, laptops broken kind of. \",\"startTime\":1740769587,\"endTime\":1740769596},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1740769597,\"endTime\":1740769598},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I''ll go and help them.\",\"startTime\":1740769599,\"endTime\":1740769600},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''m in Forks, WA and we have 4 schools in our entire district.\",\"startTime\":1740769603,\"endTime\":1740769609},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Nice, nice. You know what, I I do miss that. Like that, you know, people knowing \",\"startTime\":1740769608,\"endTime\":1740769612},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1740769610,\"endTime\":1740769610},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"you on more of a personal basis. \",\"startTime\":1740769612,\"endTime\":1740769616},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"So, so I see the bottom here, there''s like a a little thing. Yeah. So it says \",\"startTime\":1740769619,\"endTime\":1740769623},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. We''ve got nice breaker.\",\"startTime\":1740769622,\"endTime\":1740769626},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"greet your partner, then press more. OK Iceberg. OK, If you could have a superpower \",\"startTim