aker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"be on teams together, it was actually really magic. I was like you come up with \",\"startTime\":1745256347,\"endTime\":1745256350},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"all the ideas, you brainstorm all the stuff. I''ll tell you I''ll be like the \",\"startTime\":1745256350,\"endTime\":1745256354},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"crusher of dreams is like that won''t work and then. \",\"startTime\":1745256354,\"endTime\":1745256357},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And then we''ll settle on one and we''ll we''ll build something and together and. \",\"startTime\":1745256358,\"endTime\":1745256362},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So yeah, we worked together for a couple of years and then have just stayed in touch. And then, yeah, Erica, I worked with very closely until she left the \",\"startTime\":1745256362,\"endTime\":1745256372},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"school in 2022 or so. And part of I knew that I wanted to go to Spain, but also \",\"startTime\":1745256372,\"endTime\":1745256377},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I was feeling like with the change in leadership, it I just, she''s a very intense, she''s she''s brilliant in the work that she can produce and the standard of work that she creates and like just watching her like she really she could. \",\"startTime\":1745256377,\"endTime\":1745256392},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Like typing an e-mail.\",\"startTime\":1745256395,\"endTime\":1745256397},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Having a conversation and like watching Keeping Up with the Kardashians, like all at the same time. And her brain can do all of that. And so to get to work \",\"startTime\":1745256398,\"endTime\":1745256405},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"with her and see that done and just like the standard of quality that she would hold and what she could meet, but then also trying to meet that sometimes it''s like we''re not all superhuman. Like, this is really hard. \",\"startTime\":1745256405,\"endTime\":1745256416},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"But also then when she left and I worked for like a normal person, like normal person is not. \",\"startTime\":1745256417,\"endTime\":1745256423},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Doing it for me exactly. I''m a normal person who I really love and is a great \",\"startTime\":1745256425,\"endTime\":1745256428},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love it. I love it.\",\"startTime\":1745256425,\"endTime\":1745256426},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"friend. But also like you are not Erica Crane. \",\"startTime\":1745256428,\"endTime\":1745256431},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So I kind of had to step away from the school for a bit too. And now related \",\"startTime\":1745256431,\"endTime\":1745256436},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"the second question, which I won''t answer because I don''t want to ramble on too much, but but has to do with now. And it''s not a problem of practice, but \",\"startTime\":1745256436,\"endTime\":1745256444},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"it''s the problem on my mind most right now is deciding when I go back this summer, if I return to that position and that school. \",\"startTime\":1745256444,\"endTime\":1745256453},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Or if I take another position that''s been offered to me, the school that I''m developing the curriculum for has asked if I would want to teach for them. So \",\"startTime\":1745256453,\"endTime\":1745256460},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I have to decide if I want to go be a founding teacher again at an online school. \",\"startTime\":1745256460,\"endTime\":1745256463},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And the biggest thing is like, oh, do I want to sign up to be bad at something for a while? Because I really don''t like that. And I just, I know that like \",\"startTime\":1745256463,\"endTime\":1745256470},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''ll be a learner, like a super learner. And like I say, I like to be a learner \",\"startTime\":1745256470,\"endTime\":1745256473},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"and I do, but I don''t like to be like such a public learner. I''m like, I''m hey \",\"startTime\":1745256473,\"endTime\":1745256477},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"guys, can you tell me I''m learning right now because I''m not doing this well like that. \",\"startTime\":1745256477,\"endTime\":1745256483},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Intimidating to me so yeah, so I''m here because I know the right people and Erica was like it was such an honor that she asked me to like have any kind of even small role in here. But it''s because she knows me too and she knows \",\"startTime\":1745256485,\"endTime\":1745256495},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"that like I can that I''m that I would I would the person who is not already very tech savvy and very like. \",\"startTime\":1745256495,\"endTime\":1745256502},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"But I''m very much a learner when it comes to do with a lot, when it comes to do with a lot of this stuff. So yes, that''s my long answer to that question. \",\"startTime\":1745256504,\"endTime\":1745256511},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, this is great. And I think we we totally did the stories even at the beginning \",\"startTime\":1745256513,\"endTime\":1745256517},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"a little bit. But thanks for that more insight. I was wondering how. \",\"startTime\":1745256517,\"endTime\":1745256520},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256521,\"endTime\":1745256522},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What was your journey to get into side by? And that makes a lot of sense. Mine \",\"startTime\":1745256521,\"endTime\":1745256524},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"is similar but different. \",\"startTime\":1745256524,\"endTime\":1745256528},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"In that I got to work with Mike Mendelsohn 2 springs ago or three years ago this fall when we connected at a Bath conference, Northwest Math Conference. \",\"startTime\":1745256529,\"endTime\":1745256540},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And we might have connected via Chase Orton, a math friend of mine and colleague. \",\"startTime\":1745256541,\"endTime\":1745256545},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And we were working with a small district who then given grant funding. Not \",\"startTime\":1745256545,\"endTime\":1745256548},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"a super small district, a medium sized district. \",\"startTime\":1745256548,\"endTime\":1745256552},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Scope of things and but they were not able to apply the grant. And this teacher \",\"startTime\":1745256553,\"endTime\":1745256557},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"leader, she had gotten the grant money for them to do lesson studies in their school. But the school district said, no, you can''t do it in your school because \",\"startTime\":1745256557,\"endTime\":1745256565},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"we don''t have the funds to do it for all of the schools. \",\"startTime\":1745256565,\"endTime\":1745256569},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So it wouldn''t be fair. So you can''t do that. So we took that opportunity and \",\"startTime\":1745256570,\"endTime\":1745256574},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256570,\"endTime\":1745256572},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"brainstormed and Mike had his tool called up Duo and I was working professional learning for the state of Washington and for different regions. And so we brainstormed \",\"startTime\":1745256574,\"endTime\":1745256581},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"out how to make it happen. And then through that, I''ve been working with Mike \",\"startTime\":1745256581,\"endTime\":1745256585},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"the last couple years, well, three years now. \",\"startTime\":1745256585,\"endTime\":1745256589},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Ended up like, how do we bring this to education? How do we g