he next and thinking for time because we''ve gotten a full half hour. \",\"startTime\":1745256642,\"endTime\":1745256650},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"This last card when you see end there when you press end it closes, hangs up your call. \",\"startTime\":1745256650,\"endTime\":1745256656},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256651,\"endTime\":1745256651},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK, OK. Good to know.\",\"startTime\":1745256656,\"endTime\":1745256658},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So just for FYI, umm, we can chat for a little bit more if you want to or, uh, schedule a chat. I''m sure that Erica, she''s letting me in on a little bit of \",\"startTime\":1745256657,\"endTime\":1745256664},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it and she wanna make sure you get the full user experience. \",\"startTime\":1745256664,\"endTime\":1745256668},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But let''s do this card and then if you''ve got a minute, we can chat a little bit more. But I do know it''s 10:30 or whatever, 30 time it is. Here''s 30. \",\"startTime\":1745256669,\"endTime\":1745256677},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, here it''s 7:30.\",\"startTime\":1745256679,\"endTime\":1745256681},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Thank, thank 730. Yeah, thank your partner and share one thing you learned from \",\"startTime\":1745256681,\"endTime\":1745256685},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"them. Oh, thank you so much for. \",\"startTime\":1745256685,\"endTime\":1745256689},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Being human and sharing your insight to passion and learning and one thing that I learned from you is. \",\"startTime\":1745256690,\"endTime\":1745256696},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That it''s still, even though you might have done it before and knowing about all of the details, you still have to struggle with it. And it''s a good thing \",\"startTime\":1745256696,\"endTime\":1745256702},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"to just let go of it go, oh, it''s good enough. I gotta, I gotta hit print or \",\"startTime\":1745256702,\"endTime\":1745256705},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"whatever it is. \",\"startTime\":1745256705,\"endTime\":1745256708},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I struggle with that a lot personally. So thanks for that encouragement. \",\"startTime\":1745256710,\"endTime\":1745256713},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah, Yeah. Well, thank you for making this really comfortable and easy \",\"startTime\":1745256714,\"endTime\":1745256717},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"too. Like I really, yeah, enjoyed this conversation and look forward to when \",\"startTime\":1745256717,\"endTime\":1745256721},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I get to chat with you next. And I''ve got a whole, my little, my little notebook \",\"startTime\":1745256721,\"endTime\":1745256724},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"of all kinds of things, like things Jeff said I thought were great and that I want to reference again, but. \",\"startTime\":1745256724,\"endTime\":1745256731},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Oh, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1745256728,\"endTime\":1745256731},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"One of them it''s, it''s a small thing and it''s not really related to anything we were talking about, but I was like, oh, they eat math habits. Like I want \",\"startTime\":1745256732,\"endTime\":1745256738},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to look at those because even if those are math habits, like those are learner habits, like everything you were saying. And I just want to look at that and \",\"startTime\":1745256738,\"endTime\":1745256744},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"think about that as I''m very much focused right now on the science curriculum work that I''m doing. \",\"startTime\":1745256744,\"endTime\":1745256750},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And just look at where I can make sure I''m infusing those wherever possible. \",\"startTime\":1745256752,\"endTime\":1745256757},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Both in language and just in the spirit to the types of activities and things that I''m selecting for students. \",\"startTime\":1745256758,\"endTime\":1745256764},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah. So thank you for that. So it''s going to send me digging for more things \",\"startTime\":1745256765,\"endTime\":1745256767},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Oh, you''re welcome.\",\"startTime\":1745256767,\"endTime\":1745256768},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to think about. \",\"startTime\":1745256767,\"endTime\":1745256769},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, if you Google search.\",\"startTime\":1745256771,\"endTime\":1745256773},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Standards for math practices, that''s how it will come up. Standards for mathematical \",\"startTime\":1745256773,\"endTime\":1745256778},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Cool.\",\"startTime\":1745256778,\"endTime\":1745256778},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"practices in the Common Core standards. There''s the content standards and then \",\"startTime\":1745256778,\"endTime\":1745256784},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"then the practice standards. And those are the ones that resonate well and intentionally \",\"startTime\":1745256784,\"endTime\":1745256789},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"as you think about our brains being linguistic and mathematical at the core. \",\"startTime\":1745256789,\"endTime\":1745256794},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"The mathematical part, those are the habits of mind that we should all be developing all the time. Like you''ll love them. You''re like, oh, and when we would, we \",\"startTime\":1745256796,\"endTime\":1745256804},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Yeah. Yes.\",\"startTime\":1745256801,\"endTime\":1745256804},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"would talk about them with our English or science or any other teachers, they''re like, Oh my God, these are the same things we''re doing in our classes. So. \",\"startTime\":1745256804,\"endTime\":1745256811},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I think you really like him in the language is really rich, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256811,\"endTime\":1745256814},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256813,\"endTime\":1745256814},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Cool. Yes, Yeah, I''ll be looking at that soon.\",\"startTime\":1745256815,\"endTime\":1745256818},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. OK, sweet. And then, umm, I don''t know, umm, I have to check with Erica \",\"startTime\":1745256816,\"endTime\":1745256819},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"for when you and I might connect again. Just if we wanted to do a check in or \",\"startTime\":1745256819,\"endTime\":1745256823},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"call. But I know she''s got you doing some work, but I''d love any of the feedback \",\"startTime\":1745256823,\"endTime\":1745256827},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"from your experience about how it is. \",\"startTime\":1745256827,\"endTime\":1745256831},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256831,\"endTime\":1745256831},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Coming through and all of the stuff, even with our funky, quirky tools that we have right now and fun being a learner in front of other learners, knowing that it''s going to not work all the time. \",\"startTime\":1745256831,\"endTime\":1745256844},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, no, so far, great.\",\"startTime\":1745256837,\"endTime\":1745256840},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Uh, what did you say? Do I want to be bad at something or do I want to suck \",\"startTime\":1745256845,\"endTime\":1745256848},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Oh yes.\",\"startTime\":1745256846,\"endTime\":1745256846},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"at something for the first year? \",\"startTime\":1745256848,\"endTime\":1745256850},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, that''s exactly, that''s sort of what I''m. Yeah. Publicly, I thought \",\"startTime\":1745256851,\"endTime\":1745256855},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"In front of others.\",\"startTime\":1745256851,\"endTime\":1745256852},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I was done with that. Yeah, no, Yeah, I think so. I''m meeting with Erica. We \",\"startTime\":1745256855,\"endTime\":1745256859},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256855,\"endTime\":1745256856},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"have a meeting scheduled on the 29th. \",\"startTime\":1745256859,\"endTime\":1745256863},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745256860,\"endTime\":1745256861},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And I believe she wanted me to make sure I had at least two conversations.\",\"startTime\":1745256865,\"endTime\":1745256869},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Before that meeting. So that''s that''s what comes to mind right now as far as \",\"startTime\":1745256870,\"endTime\":1745256873},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Great.\",\"startTime\":1745256873,\"endTime\":1745256874},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"like what we want to try to make sure I get. \",\"startTime\":1745256873,\"endTime\":1745256877},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256875,\"endTime\":1745256875},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Then let''s be real authentic to the process and I will match you with some other educators like. \",\"startTime\":1745256879,\"endTime\":1745256884},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Curriculum authors or people who are doing remote learning or have been in that same kind of position and of leadership instructional work as well. I''ll see \",\"startTime\":1745256885,\"endTime\":1745256892},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"what I can do to partner you up. And it would be wonderful to get that feedback \",\"startTime\":1745256892,\"endTime\":1745256895},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"from your journey because it''s new and we don''t have 1000 people online yet, so you don''t get somebody right away to match. \",\"startTime\":1745256895,\"endTime\":1745256903},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256897,\"endTime\":1745256899},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256903,\"endTime\":1745256904},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Umm, not like the popular whatever games online or whatever, umm, that will get you there and it''ll be great to get your feedback from that and like what that process is like. So alright. \",\"startTime\":1745256904,\"endTime\":1745256914},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm, Great. Yeah. I''ve been keeping a doc, a document of just running notes \",\"startTime\":1745256913,\"endTime\":1745256917},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"and I shared that with Erica and think mentioned like I don''t know if they if I should share it with anybody else on the team at this point or not, but I it''s possible like that''s where I''ve been kind of keeping everything. So yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745256917,\"endTime\":1745256931},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"You''re welcome to share it with me. I would, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256928,\"endTime\":1745256930},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So that''s helpful. I''ll just share you on those. \",\"startTime\":1745256931,\"endTime\":1745256935},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Yeah, No, I would love to see. Yeah, if you want to share with that \",\"startTime\":1745256932,\"endTime\":1745256934},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"with me, that would be awesome, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745256934,\"endTime\":1745256937},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256937,\"endTime\":1745256938},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Sweet beans. Oh, I hope you have a wonderful evening. Oh, Spain.\",\"startTime\":1745256939,\"endTime\":1745256943},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Great. OK, Well, in.\",\"startTime\":1745256939,\"endTime\":1745256941},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1745256942,\"endTime\":1745256943},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, is it warm today?\",\"startTime\":1745256945,\"endTime\":1745256947},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, if you can do your year, your year in Valentine.\",\"startTime\":1745256945,\"endTime\":1745256948},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Beautiful. Like, yeah, today was the first day I was like, I gotta get out the \",\"startTime\":1745256948,\"endTime\":1745256951},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"big sun hat for my walk to town because it''s getting pretty intense. But yeah, \",\"startTime\":1745256951,\"endTime\":1745256955},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"it''s a beautiful time of year here. The humidity is not super high yet and. \",\"startTime\":1745256955,\"endTime\":1745256958},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Beautiful.\",\"startTime\":1745256959,\"endTime\":1745256959},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Love it. I love it. Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745256960,\"endTime\":1745256962},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, but looks like Tucson''s treating you OK, too. Great.\",\"startTime\":1745256960,\"endTime\":1745256963},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It is like 0 humidity pretty much and in our place we bought their cacti and palm trees already growing in. \",\"startTime\":1745256963,\"endTime\":1745256971},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Ah, no.\",\"startTime\":1745256972,\"endTime\":1745256972},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It''s wonderful. Yeah. All right. More chats later. Have a great day. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1745256973,\"endTime\":1745256977},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Nice. All right. Well, enjoy it. Yes. We''ll talk soon. You too.\",\"startTime\":1745256975,\"endTime\":1745256978}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.398817+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.398817+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 2055, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.365Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", 