r \",\"startTime\":1739898142,\"endTime\":1739898146},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"favorite hobby and why? There we go. \",\"startTime\":1739898146,\"endTime\":1739898150},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yep. And then it''ll. Yeah, there you go. Yep.\",\"startTime\":1739898148,\"endTime\":1739898150},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Actually answer the question.\",\"startTime\":1739898155,\"endTime\":1739898157},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. We''ll move through like just to play a little bit and I''ll make \",\"startTime\":1739898156,\"endTime\":1739898160},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Oh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1739898159,\"endTime\":1739898159},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"them. I might adjust some of them. Like for this one we can say what''s a hobby \",\"startTime\":1739898160,\"endTime\":1739898164},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Yeah, cool.\",\"startTime\":1739898163,\"endTime\":1739898164},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"or like something you''re trying to learn that isn''t AI related, but like, yeah, just something you''re trying to learn or you like to do that isn''t AI related. \",\"startTime\":1739898164,\"endTime\":1739898171},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"This one, this round. \",\"startTime\":1739898171,\"endTime\":1739898175},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Sure. Well my I don''t know if it''s a hobby or a sport, but I''m a skier as I \",\"startTime\":1739898177,\"endTime\":1739898182},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"said, so definitely at least this time of year. \",\"startTime\":1739898182,\"endTime\":1739898187},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898186,\"endTime\":1739898186},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"I wouldn''t say consumes, but has a lot of my.\",\"startTime\":1739898190,\"endTime\":1739898193},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Time and energy and and background thought processes.\",\"startTime\":1739898196,\"endTime\":1739898201},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Nice. Yeah, yeah, 