lready done or is immediately doing all the Super Googling that you and walking to the library and and. \",\"startTime\":1739898335,\"endTime\":1739898346},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Essentially has the library the world of libraries in its back pocket and can. \",\"startTime\":1739898347,\"endTime\":1739898353},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Pulled all the other way way faster than you ever could.\",\"startTime\":1739898356,\"endTime\":1739898358},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"And so.\",\"startTime\":1739898360,\"endTime\":1739898360},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"For me it''s like.\",\"startTime\":1739898363,\"endTime\":1739898364},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"It''s just that it''s, it''s not a, it''s not a monster.\",\"startTime\":1739898365,\"endTime\":1739898371},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"It''s it''s.\",\"startTime\":1739898374,\"endTime\":1739898375},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Just a computer that''s working has, you know, has collected all this information, like I said, and and is working way faster than you can. And it''s a, it''s a \",\"startTime\":1739898377,\"endTime\":1739898386},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"benefit. There''s nothing wrong with that. It''s there. It''s not going away. \",\"startTime\":1739898386,\"endTime\":1739898390},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898390,\"endTime\":1739898390},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"We might as well use it.\",\"startTime\":1739898396,\"endTime\":1739898397},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. And that we''re trying to work with educators who have been either \",\"startTime\":1739898398,\"endTime\":1739898401},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"told like don''t use it, don''t let your students use it, or have been given the green light without guidance or have been given the green light with a lot of guidance. Like all across that continuum, I''ve interacted with professors and \",\"startTime\":1739898401,\"endTime\":1739898412},{\"sp