ou. So keep looking back at your \",\"startTime\":1740422593,\"endTime\":1740422601},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740422596,\"endTime\":1740422597},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Absolutely.\",\"startTime\":1740422599,\"endTime\":1740422600},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"dashboard and on your dashboard there, we''ll be connecting you with other people. \",\"startTime\":1740422601,\"endTime\":1740422605},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Right now I have to play because Mike made some new things in there and I''ll meet with him today and I''ll get updates and even share them with you. But I \",\"startTime\":1740422605,\"endTime\":1740422612},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"believe the way that we''re connecting. \",\"startTime\":1740422612,\"endTime\":1740422616},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"In your dashboard, there''s fine time. You can just chat in there and say, hey, \",\"startTime\":1740422616,\"endTime\":1740422621},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"this is when it works for me. And if somebody else is at that same time, then \",\"startTime\":1740422621,\"endTime\":1740422625},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"our robot robot at Scibi will send you both a calendar invite. So it''ll be automated \",\"startTime\":1740422625,\"endTime\":1740422629},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"MMM. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1740422629,\"endTime\":1740422631},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"for you just like, hey, do you want to meet with Dale on next Monday morning at this time? And then you would be like, yes or no. So we''re trying to make \",\"startTime\":1740422629,\"endTime\":1740422638},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Love it.\",\"startTime\":1740422636,\"endTime\":1740422637},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"it seamless and easy for you and also keep your inbox from being cluttered up with too many things. We know there''s too many things in our. \",\"startTime\":1740422638,\"endTime\":1740422646},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yea